[ed-m p. 102]
kalpāntoddāmadhāmasphuradamitajaganmātṛlīlāyitaśrīr
unmīlaccitrasenābahalitaparamānandamūrtir bhavāriḥ |
bhāvyaḥ sambodhilakṣmīsahajasukharasollāsitasvāntavṛttyā
sadvṛttair ity agūḍhaṃ draḍhayati padavīm ittham asyābhayo 'sau || 1 ||

karoti vajradevīnām ādeśāt svapnasaṃśrutāt |
ṭīkāṃ buddhakapāle 'smiṃs tadadhiṣṭhānato 'bhayaḥ || 2 ||

nūnaṃ tenādyanāthenādhiṣṭhito vajriṇāpy aham |
yatas taduktayaḥ svārthaṃ kathayantīva karṇayoḥ || 3 ||

mudaṃ bhajata sajjanāḥ śucam udañcatāsādhavas
tamas tribhavavarti re 'pasara dūram arvāgdṛśaḥ |
udety abhayapaddhateḥ kim api dhāma dharmāspadaṃ
spṛśaty asamasampadaṃ vimṛśataś ca madhyasthiteḥ || 4 ||

caturdaśapaṭalātmakasyāsya buddhakapālatantrasya buddhakapālo bhagavān deśako 'bhidheyaś ca. evaṃ ca deśyadaiśikasambandho 'bhidhānābhidheyasambandhaś coktaḥ. vineyānāṃ ca buddhakapālārthapratipattiḥ prayojanam. vajropamamahāsukhaikarasā sakalajagadupakāriṇī mahāmudrāsiddhiḥ prayojanaprayojanam.

tatraivaṃ mayetyādy abhūvann ityantam ādau nidānam, asmin sati hi deśanāpravṛtteḥ. kāladeśadeśakaparṣatsāmagrī hi deśanāyā nidānam, enāṃ vinā deśanānupapatteḥ. tatra evaṃ mayeti mama dharmaḥ saṃgātavyas tathānupūrvīṃ pratipādyety uktaṃ bhagavatā dharmasaṃgītisūtre. ataḥ [ed-m p. 103] saṃgītikāras tathaiva saṃgāyati sma. ko 'tra saṃgītikāraḥ? kim anena nāmanirṇayena? bhagavadādeśenaiva tena vacanād bhagavata evedaṃ vacanam. vadanti punar atra samarpitatantratvād vajrapāṇir iti.

tatra saṃgāsyamānam aviparītaṃ sakalaṃ tantrārtham evam ity ayaṃ nipāto dyotayati. ato 'yam evaṃkāraḥ sakalatantrārthenārthavān sampadyate, tantrārthasya ca prajñopāyamayatayākṣaradvayāvayavabhāvenāvasthita ity upadiśanti. mayeti mayā saṃgītikṛtā. śrutam iti śrotravijñānena vyañjanato manovijñānenārthato 'vagatam. na tv idaṃ mayā sākṣātkṛtam, bhagavata evāsmin dharme sarvākāram adhigamād iti dharme gauravam upadarśayati.

evaṃ sāmānyenopakṣipyaviśeṣataḥ sanidānaṃ kramaśodarśayati—ekasmin samaya ityādi. ekaḥ kaścid asāv anekapuṇyajñānasambhāropanatas tithinakṣatrādibhir aparicchedyo 'cintyaḥ kālaviśeṣaḥ. sa punar atra caturthakṣaṇarūpaḥ samaya ity ākhyāyate. tasminn ekasmin samaye bhagavān sthitā abhūvann iti vacanavipariṇāmena sthito 'bhūd iti sambandhaḥ. bhago 'syāstīti bhagavān. sa punar aiśvaryādayo guṇāḥ. tad uktam—

	aiśvaryasya samagrasya rūpasya yaśasaḥ śriyaḥ |
	jñānasyātha prayatnasya ṣaṇṇāṃ bhaga iti śrutiḥ ||

iti. caturo mārān bhagnavān iti vā bhagavān. athavā sarvadharmanairvedhikī kleśamārādiniṣūdanī prajñā bhagaḥ, so 'sya tādātmyenāstīti bhagavān. tad uktaṃ vajraśekharatantre— [ed-m p. 104]

	prajñāvadhyāś ca te kleśās tasmāt prajñā bhagocyate | [cf. Sekoddeśaṭīkā p. 65 I. 6]

iti.

sarve ca te tathāgatāś ca sarvatathāgatā akṣobhyādayaḥ, teṣāṃ kāyavākcittāni. vajraṃ śūnyatā, tadrūpaṃ mahān svaparārthasampaāv alam atyarthaṃ niruaraṃ kāraḥ kriyā vyāpāro yasyāḥ sā mahālaṃkārā vajragarvā prajñāpāramitātmikā tasyā maṇḍaṃ sāraṃ bodhicittaṃ lāti gṛhṇātīti maṇḍalaṃ dharmodayam. sarvatathāgatakāyavākcittāni tad vajramahālaṃkāramaṇḍalaṃ ca. sarvatathāgatakāyavākciarūpatvaṃ cāsya tadekarasatvāt. ata eva ca tryasram. tasya madhye. iha kūṭāgārasyānuktatve 'pi dharmodayāmadhyasthe kūṭāgāra ity arthāt pratipattavyam. tadyathā nagare vasaty āḍhya iti nagarasthe prāsāda ity arthād bhavati. tathā tu noktaṃ mahāsukhabhūmeḥ prādhānyopadarśanārtham. kūṭāgāram api hi tadekarasam eva. athavā vajraṃ śūnyatā dharmodayā tasmin mahālaṃkāramaṇḍalaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ tanmadhye. evaṃbhūtadeśe bhagavataḥ sthityupadarśanena śūnyatākaruṇābhinnaḥ sahajakāyo visphuṭam āveditaḥ. tenaiva ca kāyena tantradeśanāpi tadekarasā darśitā.

evaṃ kāladeśadeśakasampad uktā. parṣatsampadam āha—sarvetyādi. akṣobhyādibhis tathāgataiś citrasenādibhir yoginībhir āryānandādibhiś cādhiṣṭhite. vītarāgopādānaṃ śrāvakayānikānām upalakṣaṇatvāt pāramitāyānikānām api vajrayānenaiva mahāsukhamayasambodhisiddhir iti [ed-m p. 105] jñāpanārtham. lokeśvarādayaś ca tatra sthitā abhūvan. etac ca nidānavākyaṃ yathāsambhavam asmābhiḥ savistaraṃ śrīsampuṭaṭīkāyāṃ niṣṭa˙nkitaṃ sudhībhir avadhāryam.

nidānānurūpāṃ bhagavato deśanāṃ saṃgītikṛd athetyādinā prastauti. vajraṃ śūnyatāsvarūpāṇi pañca jñānāni dharatīti śūnyatākaruṇābhinnaḥ sahajamahāsukhasvabhāvo vajradharaḥ. mahāmudrā mahāsukhaikarasā jagadupakāriṇī śūnyatā. saiva vajraṃ sarvāvaraṇabhedanāt, padaṃ ca pratiṣṭhā svaparārthasampadaḥ. tad eva sarvais tantrair mantraiś ca pramāṇopapannatvāt paramopādeyatvena suṣṭhu deśitam. tena sarvatathāgatānāṃ vairocanādīnāṃ svāmineti svāmī. svāmitvena niruttaro 'sau śāsteti sūcayati. vajram ātmanaḥ padmaṃ citrasenāyās tayoḥ samāyogena. yoṣic citrasenā tasyā bhago dharmodayā. adhyātmaṃ tu vajraṃ bodhicittam, padmāny uṣṇīṣādīni tāny eva yoṣito 'vadhūtyā bhagāni. parinirvṛto bodhicittarūpo dravībhūta ity arthaḥ. paramārthatas tu yoṣit prajñā citrasenā samantabhadrāparanāmakā, tasyā bhagaḥ śūnyatā. bahuvacanaṃ sarvayoṣitsaṃhārarūpatvāc citrasenāyāḥ. bhagavāṃs tatra mahāmudrāvajrapadena

	prajñayā na bhave sthānaṃ kṛpayā na śame sthitiḥ | [Abhisamayālaṃkāra 10ab]

ity apratiṣṭhitanirvāṇena parinirvṛtaḥ. tadātmako bhūtvaikalolīsvabhāvena samastabhedāparāmarṣād āsaṃsāram aparimitatathāgatabodhisattvayoginīvītarāgamudrāmaṇḍalamantrakoṭibhiḥ sārdham avikalpako 'pi san pūrvāvedhavaśāt sarvasattveṣu kiṃkaravāṇinyāyenāvasthita ity arthaḥ. tathāpi paramagambhīro 'yaṃ mayādhigato dharmaḥ, sattvāś ca prāyaśo [ed-m p. 106] mandapuṇyā duṣprajñā hīnayānādhimuktikāḥ, tat ka enam adhimokṣayiṣyaty apīty adhimātravineyānām ādareṇa tvaraṇārthaṃ nirvṛto 'dhigamadharmaṃ deśayituṃ nirvyāpāro 'nutsāha iti yāvat. tam iti bhavaśamānavasthānam anutsāhaṃ ca. paramakṛpāprajñāyoge kiṃkaravāṇinyāye nāvasthitaḥ katham anutsāha ity adbhutaprāptāḥ. citrasenām iti citraṃ vicitram adbhutaṃ ca senā mahāsukhaṃ yasyās tām.

yoginīti

	prajñopāyasamāpattir yoga ity abhidhīyate | [Guhyasamājatantra, samājottara, 18.33ab]

so 'tyantam asty asyāḥ. ata eva praśnavisarjane samartheti pṛcchati—asti kaścid upāyo yena sattvāḥ sāmarthyaṃ svaparahitaniṣpādanaśaktiṃ labhante.

tantrādiṣu mantropāyadeśanāyāṃ kuta iyam āśa˙nkety āha—ṣaṣṭītyādi.

atra piṇḍārthaḥ. yāni tantrādīny uktāni munīndrais teṣu mantreṇa vinā sāmarthyaṃ na dṛśyate.
mantre tu bahvyaḥ śa˙nkā utpadyante. tathā hi mṛdumadhyādhimātrapuṇyānāṃ sattvānāṃ yathākramaṃ koṭilakṣāyutajāpaiḥ siddhim uktavān mahāvajrī. ahaṃ ca kiṃ mṛdvādiṣv antargato na veti saṃdehavān mandacittena kathaṃ mantraṃ japet. rāgādyupahatānāṃ mithyājñānināṃ tato rāgādeḥ katham mantrajāpaḥ. rāgāviṣṭā sattvā iti pāṭhe teṣām ity adhyāhāryam. ajñānāṃ tantra mantrajāpe lekhā gaṇanāsambhavo 'pi kathaṃ kliṣṭacittena?

[ed-m p. 107] samyagjñānino 'py atyantam atikrāntabhāvābhāvāntaṃ cittaṃ nidyaptaṃ nirūpitaṃ yena. niṣṭhāntasya kvacit paranipātaḥ. tasya mantraḥ kathaṃ mantro mantraṇīyo japyaḥ, tataś cittanidhyapteḥ. mananaṃ man, trāṇaṃ traḥ. śūnyatākaruṇābhinnaṃ jñānaṃ pāramārthiko mantraḥ, tata eva svaparārthasāmarthyasiddheḥ. kiṃ mantrajāpeneti bhāvaḥ. sarvatra katham iti praśne.
evam ity uktakrameṇa. prekṣāvān na japet. tatrāpi saty api jāpe siddhir anyathā na siddhiḥ. tārakalpakoṭir iti tṛtīyārthe prathamā. ākāśe 'parimitatārāvad aparimitakalpakoṭyā. tatheti yathā śa˙nkāyāṃ jāpo na sambhavati tathārthasaṃśayādinā kadācit saty api jāpe siddhir api. bhagavanteti bhagavataḥ. mahādevy agramahiṣī. ata eva bhagavān iva sarvatantrādhipā sarvatantradeśanāyogyatayā. tathā hīyaṃvajravārāhīrūpā lakṣābhidhānavajraḍākatantrayor deśikety uktam. bhagavān eveyam iti hi bhāvaḥ. īśvarī sarvatrāpratihatācintyaśaktiyogāt. seti tayā. avalokitamātreṇa vyavalokanamātreṇa.

bhagavanteti bhagavataḥ. kapāle iti kapālāt. kaṃ sukhaṃ pālayatīti

kapālaṃ bodhicittabījam anāhatam. tasmān mantro niścarati.

idam atrākūtam. bhrūmadhye jñānabījaṃ bindvākāraṃ bhāvayedv iti vacanād bhrūmadhye bindvākāraṃ cittaṃ bhāvanayā sthirīkṛtya tato mantraṃ sphārayed iti. athavā bhagavataḥ sambandhinaḥ kapālāc citrasenādharmodayātaḥ. yad vakṣyati—tasyāḥ kapāle maṇḍalaṃ mantratantrasuvyavasthitam iti. ayam atrāmnāyaḥ. bhagavato mahāsukhacakrasthānāhatād [ed-m p. 108] avadhūtyādhomārgeṇa niḥsṛtya bhagavatyā dharmodayāyāṃ praviśyāvadhūtyā mukhād bhrūmadhyān mantraniḥsaraṇam anulomena vilomena praveśa iti.

ayam evārtha evam ityādi kapāle praviṣṭa ityantena spaṣṭīkṛtaḥ. vidhvaṃsayeti vidhvasya.

citrasenātra bhagavatyāś citrasenāyā avadhūtīnāḍī tasyā mukhe bhrūmadhye praviṣṭo bodhicittena saha dravībhūyādhaḥ kapālasya dharmodayāyā udare ca praviṣṭas tato niḥsṛtya bhagavato vajramārgeṇordhvam anāhate vilomena praviṣṭaḥ. eṣa ity etasya. nāgānām iti nāgāḥ. sarve nāgā maharddhikā iti sambandhaḥ. vāsukikarkoṭādyā anye 'pi ye kecid viṣasambhavā dṛṣṭidaṃṣṭrālālāsparśajvālotsṛṣṭaviṣāṇi sambhavanti yebhyaḥ. ājñaptā vayaṃ devi. bruvan bruvantaḥ. āha citrasenā. evam iti buddhetyādiśravaṇānantaram eva. bhagavataḥ kapālaṃ vyākhyātam. sphuṭitvā vikāśya. bhrūmadhyasthabindor ālikālisvabhāvatvāt pustakaṃ sarvadharmasamuccayasvabhāvaṃ lipipatrātmakaṃ mantra iva niṣkrāmati. 

athavā pv iti pullīramalaye. steti puṣṭikaram. kaṃ sukham iti pustakaṃ bodhicittam. tad eva lipipatrātmakaṃ pustakaṃ bhavatīty arthaḥ. ākāśe ity āvṛttivyākhyānād ākāśe dharmodaye vajrapadmasaṃyogasamaye dhvanir nādo bhavati yadā tadā pustakaṃ niḥsarati tadaiva devair ākāśe dhvaniḥ kriyamāṇo bhavati.

tantram iti. tantraṃ prabandhaḥ. tat punas trividhaṃ hetuphalopāyabhedāt. tatrānādinidhanā herukātmakatā hetutantram, tām eva hetūkṛtya phalaherukasyodayāt. āgantukamalāpagamān niḥśeṣajagadarthakārī [ed-m p. 109 - from after phala] phalaherukaḥ phalatantram. tasyaiva viśuddhyupāya upāyatantram. gāruḍādaya upāyā˙ngatvenopāyāḥ. sākṣād upāyas tu mahāmudrāsiddhisamaye mudrāyogato yathoktam anuṣṭhānam. tasyāpy utpannakramaḥ sākṣād upāyaḥ. tasyotpattikramaḥ.

mahārājam iti mahatyāḥ svaparārthasampadaḥ sampādanena sattvarañjanāt. asya nirdeśaḥ sarvasattvopakārakam iti. pratinirdeśaḥ sarvasattvasukhāvaham iti. sarvasiddhīti. yataḥ sarvāḥ siddhayo 'smāt. yoginīyānam iti yoginītantram. yānti tad iti yānty aneneti ca phalahetūpāyasvabhāvam. niruttaram iti nirdiśati—śīghraṃ phaladāyakam iti. tatra sākṣādupāyatayotpannakramaṃ tāvad uddiśati—stobhetyādi. stobha uttejyamānaṃ vajram, adhyātmaṃ tu bodhicittam. stambha āśrayatvāt padmam. tajjaṃ sahajaṃ sarvadharmakandatayā mahājñānam, nirāvaraṇamahāsukhatayā  niruttaram. padeti padaṃ pratiṣṭhā svaparārthasampatteḥ. nāḍīsaṃcāravarjitaṃ vā padam. durlabhaṃ kauśīdyādyupahatānām. rahasyam aprakāśyaṃ śrāvakādibhyaḥ. ata eva paramam utkṛṣṭaṃ tīkṣṇaprajñānām upacitapuṇyānām eva viṣayatvāt. ramyam ānandādiyuktam. sarvadehe vyavasthitam iti sarvatrānuparatam anubhavān mahāsukhasya parisphuṭatām āha, dehasyaiva tadekarasasyodayāt tara˙ngasyeva jalāt.

evam sarvavastuvyāpakatvena māṇḍaleyasahita eva maṇḍaleśo deśitaḥ. upāyā˙ngam uddiśati. gāruḍam ityādi māraṇaṃ yāvad dvādaśa karmāṇi. utpattikramam uddiśati. nānāmantram iti hūṃkārādy utpattyādibījam. yathānyāyaṃ vakṣyamāṇapaṭaloktena vidhinā. yoginīnāṃ citrasenādīnām. yathodayaṃ yathāyogam utpattiḥ. herukaṃ ceti herukasya ca mahāvīrasya. utpattikāraṇaṃ candrādi, sthitikāraṇaṃ dharmodayādi. ayam utpattikramaḥ prathamaṃ bhāvyaḥ. iha hi mantramahāyāna [ed-m p. 110] 

ādikarmikasattvānāṃ prathamam avatārāya devatāmūrtibhāvanaiva kathyate. yad āha—

	ādikarmikasattvānāṃ devatāmūrtibhāvanā | 
	nirdiṣṭā prathamaṃ tantre sarvakarmaprasiddhaye || [Source unidentified. Quoted in Yogaratnamālā ad HT 1.1.10.] 

iti.

utpattikramasya sākṣād upeya utpannakrama iti yādṛśa utpattikrama upāya iti ca pratipādayitum utpattikramoddeśānantaraṃ kramadvayaviśeṣaṇam āha—bhāvetyādi. bhāvābhāvayor adhyāropitayoḥ sakalāparāropavyāpakayor abhāvād bhāvābhāvaniṣprapañcam. āvaraṇadvayalepābhāvān nirlepam. na tarhi parārthakṛtyaṃ śrāvakanirvāṇavad iti āha—bhavacārakam iti. nirāvaraṇasyāpi parārthaṃ mahākaruṇayā niravadhikālaṃ saṃsāropādānāt. tad uktaṃ paramādyatantre—

	yāvat saṃsāravāsasthā bhavanti varasūrayaḥ | 
	tāvat sattvārtham atulaṃ śaktāḥ kartum anirvṛtāḥ || [cf. Adhyardhaśatikā p. 23 II. 4–5]

iti.

punar upāyā˙ngam uddiśati—sandhyābhāṣam ityādi. pratimāsphoṭanādikhaḍgāntāni dvādaśa karmāṇi. pūrvāparakarmakathanenotpattikramasthasyotpannakramasthasya ca buddhakapālayogena sarvaṃ karmasiddhyatīti sūcayati. ata eva māraṇarasayor upalakṣaṇatvenobhayatropādānam. antardhānam ity ātmanaḥ. avarety aśreṣṭhā. [ed-m p. 111]
	
	duṣkarair niyamais tīvrair mūtriḥ śuṣyati duḥkhitā |
	duḥkhād vikṣipyate cittaṃ vikṣepāt siddhir anyathā || [Quoted in Sutaka, pl 463, attributed to the Paramādyatantra, but not found there by Wedemeyer.]

ity āha—pañcakāmasevyamāna iti.

	sarvāsām eva māyānāṃ strīmāyaiva viśiṣyate |
	jñānatrayaprabhedo 'yaṃ sphuṭam atraiva lakṣyate || [Pañcakrama 2.34ab]

iti nyāyena pañcasu kāmeṣūpabhujyamāneṣu pradhānaṃ strīsevā, upāyakauśalena mahāmudrāsiddhihetutvāt. atas tadarthaṃ vājīkaraṇam nirdeṣṭum āha—ghoramardīti. ghorāṇāṃ vikalpānāṃ sahajodayakāle 'sta˙ngamanān mardanayogyam. mahāyuddhaṃ rativaicitryaṃ kriyamāṇam ekena puṃsā tatra strīlakṣaṃ jīyate 'bhibhūyate vājīkaraṇena. kim evaṃ dṛśyata iti āha—ekapuṃsa iti. ekaḥ pumān mahākāmī dṛśyata āryadharmodgatādir aṣṭaṣaṣṭistrīsahasrāṇām upalakṣaṇatvāt strīlakṣam abhibhavann iti śeṣaḥ. tasmāt kāmayet. ekenety ekaḥ. sarvān iti sarvāḥ. atra copāyo vājīkaraṇam iti. bodhicittasya drāvaṇaṃ dhāraṇaṃ vṛddhiś ca. etat trayaṃ yathā bhavati tad vakṣyāmaḥ.

ata ityādinā gāruḍaṃ nirdiśati. yathānāmam iti yathā prasiddhaṃ bhavati tathā vakṣyāmi. śālikīkaraṇaṃ vidyādharakaraṇaṃ [ed-m p. 112] ca pratinirdekṣyati. dyūtaṃ pāśakaṃ tatkhelanaṃ viṣaṃ śamayati. paṭahavādanaṃ daṣṭasya striyā haraṇam. karavīrakāṣṭhikayā śiraḥprabhṛti pādāntaṃ yāvad dhananam. pāśeti. pāśākārayā rajjvā gale baddhvā kaṭṭanam. kokilaśabdoccāraṇam. padmotsthālam iti. adhyātmaṃ padmeṣu yathopadeśaṃ vāyor unmūlitāśrayo nirodhaḥ. anyas tu saṃbhogacakranāḍīdvayayantraṇam āha. vyāghrīkaraṇaṃ vyāghryā ivākramaṇābhinayenākramaṇam. udakaṃ pratinirdekṣyati. śaṇkham iti śaṇkhadhvaniḥ. khaṭikāharaṇam iti. khaṭikayā daṣṭasya nāmalikhanād viṣaharaṇam. uttāraṇam iti vamanam. karpaṭenācchādanam. carpaṭam iti capeṭena hananam. tryakṣaram iti ṭakkareṇa hananam. haho hrīr iti tryakṣareṇa viṣanāśanam iti kaścit. dhyānadṛṣṭikatheti. śuklākārādibhāvanādṛṣṭyā kathā kartavyā. ity ebhir aṣṭādaśaprayogair viṣasyākṛṣṭir bhavati.

utpannakramam uddiṣṭaṃ nirdiśati—ata ityādi. divi sukhāvatyāṃ padme bhavaṃ divyaṃ jñānaṃ sahajānandaḥ. yathaikānekasvabhāvarahitatvena niḥsvabhāvatayā tathyaṃ saṃvṛtisatyam. bhagaṃ padmaṃ tasya madhye āśraye vyavasthitaṃ vikalpān avadhūya sthitaṃ bhavanirvāṇāpratiṣṭhayā. tad kutaṃ hevajre—

	vihare 'ham sukhāvatyāṃ sadvajrayoṣito bhage |
	ekārākṛtirūpe tu buddharatnakaraṇḍake || [Hevajratantra 2.2.38]

iti tathā— [ed-m p. 113]

	yoṣidbhage sukhāvatyāṃ śukranāmnā vyavasthitaḥ | 
	vinā tena na saukhyaṃ syāt sukhaṃ hitvā bhaven na saḥ || [Hevajratantra 2.2.41cd-42a]

iti. tathā—

	sahajānandasvabhāvo 'haṃ paramāntaviramādikam | [Hevajratantra 2.2.48ab]

iti. atra śukranāmneti bodhicittākārasyaiva cetasas tathā prakāśanāt. paramāntaviramādikam iti. paramasyānto virama ādir yasya. paramānantaraṃ viramas tadanantaraṃ sahajam ity arthaḥ. matāntare tu viramasyādiḥ. paramaviramayor antarāla ity arthaḥ. etac ca matam asaṃgatam.

	viramādau lakṣayet tac ca ānandatrayavarjitamxiii | [Hevajratantra 1.10.18cd]

iti vacanāt. anena hi viramaś cāsāv ādiś ceti [RaĀ>] viramakāla evāsannodayaṃ sahajam ādita eva lakṣayed iti pratipāditam. sahajodaye tu sarvavikalpānām astamayāt kuto lakṣaṇam. [>RaĀ] ata evāryapādaiḥ—

	jñānatrayaprabhedo 'yaṃ sphuṭam atraiva lakṣyate | [Pañcakrama 3.34cd]

[ed-m p. 114]

ity anenānandatrayasya lakṣaṇam alakṣaṇaṃ caturthasyoktam. bhagavatā ca

	vilakṣaṇaṃ tribhyo 'nyat [Hevajratantra 2.3.8c]

ity anena. [RaĀ>] ataḥ kathaṃ sahajānantaram viramopapattiḥ, aśakyalakṣaṇatvāt. viramānantaram anusmaraṇasyaiva lakṣaṇatve 'nubhavopāyo na darśitaḥ syāt.sahajodayasthāne tv avipratipattir eva. nanv ādāv api kuto lakṣaṇam ananubhūtatvād eva. na. uṣaḥkāla iva sandhyāyāḥ. nanu tathāpi tadrūpam anupalakṣitam eva. satyam, anubhavopāyas tv evam upadiśyate. nanv *evam* upāyo 'pi bhavituṃ nārhati, tataḥ prabhṛti tadupalakṣaṇābhiniveśino 'sya tadasambhavāt. satyaṃ yady evaṃ syāt. tatra tu tathodīyamāne yathā kartavyaṃ tathā guravo vakṣyanti. evam ubhayatrāpi mate upalakṣaṇakramaḥ sūcitaḥ. viramasya ** sahajānantaratve tantrāntarāṇi ṣoḍaśārdhārdhabindudhṛg [Nāmasaṃgīti 10.2b] mudrāsiddhiś ca vighaṭate. sahajānubhavopāyaś ca na sambhavati. sahajasvarūpam eva kevalaṃ na vighaṭata iti pūrvakam eva matam āmnāyavido vadantīty alam atiprasaṅgena.

tad divyajñānaṃ dṛṣṭāntatvena laukikasahajasukham eva mahāsukhasya sādhyasya sādhanaṃ draṣṭavyam ity āha—mahāsukhapradāyakam iti. tadupāyabhūtaṃ sahajaṃ yathopadeśam abhyasyamānam akṣaraṃ mahāsukhaṃ nirāvaraṇaṃ niratiśayam upeyam upajanayati. anayor upāyopeyasukhayos tattvaṃ naiḥsvābhāvyalakṣaṇā śūnyataiva. ye tu sukham eva tattvaṃ pratītya sthitās teṣāṃ bhramanirāsārtham uktaṃ bhagavatā—[ed-m p. 115]

	tasmāt saukhyaṃ na tattvākhyaṃ mahābhūtaṃ yataḥ sukham | [Hevajratantra 1.10.40cd]

iti.

sahajam api sarvadā sarvatra na bhavati. tathā hi sahajaṃ vastusvarūpaṃ tat pāramārthikaṃ śūnyataiva sāṃvṛtaṃ bodhaḥ. sukhaṃ tu yadi nāma bodhas tathāpi na sarvadā sarvatra sahajaṃ duḥkhopekṣānubhavakāle caturthe dhyāne ārūpyadhātau ca bodhavad ananubhūyamānatvāt. yat tūktaṃ nāmasaṃgītyām—caturthadhyānakoṭidhṛg [Nāmasaṅgīti 10.3d] iti tatra caturthadhyānasya sahajānandasya koṭau sarvakalpanāmalarahite prakarṣaparyante tādātmyenāvasthitatvāt tatsvarūpadhārīty arthaḥ. mahāsukhamayaniravadhidhātutrayīpratibhāse sati dhyānādikam api mahāsukhamayaṃ bhagavata eva nānyasyety evam uktam āvṛttivyākhyānārtham.
kathaṃ tarhi sukhaṃ sahajam ucyate? yathānālambanā mahākṛpādṛṣṭatattvasyāvidyamānādhimokṣeṇa bhāvyamānādhigatatattvasya bodhātmakatvāt sāṃvṛtaṃ svarūpaṃ sahajam ucyate tathā sukhaṃ kadācid anubhavāvasthāyām ananubhavāvasthāyāṃ cādṛṣṭatattvenādhimokṣeṇa mahākṛpābhinnasvabhāvaṃ śūnyatātmakaṃ sarvākāravaropetaṃ bhāvyamānaṃ tattvādhigamāvasthāyāṃ lokottaraṃ sāṃvṛtaṃ sahajam ucyate. tattvānadhigamāvasthāyāṃ tv anubhūyamānaṃ laukikaṃ sāṃvṛtaṃ sahajaṃ sahajacchāyānukāritvāt. tathā coktam—

	sahajābhyāṃ yad utpannaṃ sahajaṃ tan nigadyate |
	svabhāvaṃ sahajam ity uktaṃ sarvākāraikasaṃvaram ||
	
	kṛpopāyo bhaved yogī mudrā hetuviyogataḥ |
	śūnyatākaruṇābhinnaṃ bodhicittam iti smṛtam || [Hevajratantra 1.10.41–42]

[ed-m p. 116] iti. atra saṃvriyante 'sminn iti saṃvaraḥ. sarveṣām ākārāṇāṃ nīlapītādīnām eko 'dvitīyaḥ saṃvaraḥ, sahajasyaiva tathā tathā pratibhāsanāt. sahajau punar yābhyām utpannaṃ sahajam ucyate tau kṛpāmudre. ataḥ kṛpānālambanā mahākaruṇā mahāsukhamayī sā upāyo yasya sa evaṃbhūto yogī bhavet. etad uktam—upāyatattvam idaṃ sukhaṃ na tu prajñātattvam. mudrā śūnyatā saiva sarvadharmāṇām anutpādalakṣaṇā paramā prajñā hetuviyogato hetor abhāvāt, ādyanutpannatvāt sarvadharmāṇām. etau ca svabhāvau sahajāv eva, svataḥ siddhatvāt. ābhyām utpannaṃ tattvaṃ bodhicittaṃ śūnyatākaruṇābhinnam. tat kim idaṃ prajñājñānād anyad eva? nānyat. tasyaivedaṃ vipakṣavyudāsena svarūpaṃ prakāśitam. evaṃvidhaṃ tad iti. idam eva sahajābhyāṃ prajñājñānasvarūpābhyām abhyāsād utpannaṃ bodhicittaṃ caturtho mahāmudrābhiṣekaḥ sarvavikalpamalānāṃ sākṣād anena kṣālanāt. tad uktam—caturthaṃ tat punas tatheti. [Samājottara 113]

sahajarūpatām eva viśvasya darśayann āha—tatraivetyādi. tatraiva divyajñāne bhāvābhāvādisamastāropaśūnyataikarase sthitās tādātmyena sarve bāleti bālāḥ pṛthagjanāḥ. nanu katham ātmasvarūpam api na jānanti. yato mohitāḥ. bhāvābhāvādigrahaviparyāso 'jñānaṃ ca mohaḥ saṃjāta eṣām. tad eva jñānaṃ raso mahāsukhaṃ rasāyanaṃ balavaiśāradyādiguṇapuṣṭihetutvāt. tur viśeṣe. bāhyarasādibhyo viśiṣṭam ity arthaḥ. tathaivābhyasyamānaṃ mahāsukhapradāyakaṃ yathā. vicitrākārasya bhāvābhāvādirahitasya vastuno yathābhūtasya bodhād buddhā vaimalyapariśuddhyā balavaiśāradyādijñānamayā avasthitāḥ. anena cittavajrasvarūpo dharmakāyaḥ kathitaḥ.

maṇḍalam iti. nīlapītādivicitrākāraṃ śūnyatākaruṇābhinnasamāpannadevatārūpam ānandādibhedabhinnaṃ janmamaraṇotpādanirodharūpaspharaṇasaṃharaṇakārivajrasattvarūpaṃ maṇḍalacakraṃ [ed-m p. 117 - begin after mahāsukha] mahāsukhamayam eva. divyam utpannarūpam. caturthārtha eva bhāvyamānaḥ siddhaḥ saṃś caturtho 'bhiṣeko bhavatīty āha—tatraiva svaśiṣyasecanam iti. yat tu bhagamadhye secanam utpattikrameṇa tad vakṣyati. 

herukam iti. heruko bhagavān sambhogakāyātmā. pāramitānaye daśabhūmīśvarabodhisattvānāṃ gambhīrodāradharmadeśanayā dharmasambhogā˙ngatvena dvātriṃśallakṣaṇāśītyanuvyañjanātmakaḥ kāya eva sambhogakāyaḥ. iha tv asau dharmakāyavaśena vineyānurodhato herukādirūpeṇa tathā tathā nirmitena nirmāṇakāya ucyate. yas tu nirmitabuddho nirmāṇakāyaḥ pāramitānaye kathyate so 'trāpi tadvad eva nirmitavac ca. saty api dharmakāyanirmitatve sambhogakāyasya pāramitānaye pṛthaktvaṃ dharmasambhogād eva. iha tu vāgrūpatayāpi. sambhogatvaṃ ca rasasambhogato 'pi.

nirmūlitasakalavipakṣatvād vīraḥ. adhyātmaṃ maṇḍale ca devīnāṃ vakṣyamāṇānāṃ caturviṃśater mahāsukharasapānād dharmavācā pālanāc cādhipaḥ. niravadhivividhakāyaspharaṇena parārthaṃ prati prabhaviṣṇutvāt prabhuḥ. gāruḍaṃ viṣaśamanopāyaḥ paramaḥ śūnyataiva. yad vakṣyati—

	śūnyeṣu sarvadharmeṣu sarpo viṣaṃ kathaṃ tataḥ.

iti.

śūnyatānadhimuktānāṃ bhayahetutvād ghoram. daityasādhanam iti. na hi tad asti yan na tathā jñānayogino vaśībhavati. śmaśānam ity utpattikrame śvasatīti śavānāṃ vasatir iti nairuktena vidhinā nairātmyalakṣaṇadharmadhātudyotakaśavānām āvāsaḥ śmaśānam aṣṭasaṃkhyāvacchinnaṃ vakṣyāmaḥ. iha tu dharmadhāturūpaṃ śarīram evāṣṭāṅgaṃ śmaśānam. [ed-m p. 118] 

pāramitānaye trikalpāsaṃkhyeyair buddhatvotpattir uktā. iha tv aniyatakālenety āha—jhaṭity utpattikāraṇam iti. trisāhasramaharddhikā iti. trisāhasrādilokadhātuṣu mahatī aparimitavicitranirmāṇarūpā ṛddhir yeṣāṃ te tathā. anena nirmāṇakāyaḥ kāyavajra uktaḥ.

bhājanaloko 'pi tatsvabhāva ity āha—lokadhātv iti. lokadhātavaḥ. saiveti mahāmudrā. paramaratisthānatvād devī. sarvabuddhānāṃ jananī hetvavasthāsvabhāvā. bodhisattvānāṃ mahālakṣmīḥ puṇyajñānasambhārasvabhāvā. phalāvasthāyāṃ tu prajñāpāraparāyaṇī prajñāyāḥ pāre prakarṣaparyante parāyaṇī sākalyena gatā prajñāpāramitety arthaḥ. narakadvāram iti tatpratikṣeptṝṇām. yathoktaṃ rājaratnāvalyām—

	aparo 'py asya durjñānān mūrkhaḥ paṇḍitamānikaḥ |
	pratikṣepavinaṣṭātmā yāty avīcīm adhomukhaḥ || [Nāgārjuna, Ratnāvalī, 2.20]

iti.

sa eva saiva. sarvāvaraṇavigamo mokṣaḥ. śūnyataikarasānalambanamahākaruṇāsvabhāvamahāsukhamayo 'śeṣajagadarthakārī caturthaḥ kāyo mahāmudrā. aparakāyatrayasyaitanmayatvān mahāyaśāḥ. ata eva sarvasattvahitakāminī, mahākaruṇāsvabhāvatvāt. mahāsukhākāreṇa viśvasya jananāj jananī.saṃvṛtiparamārthasatyavibhāgabhāvanayotpannatvād bhāgineyī. saṃvṛtiparamārthasatyayor vibhāgakathanād bhaginī. balavaiśāradyādiniruttaraguṇasyākāśadhenor duhanād utpādanād duhitā. niruttarasukhenānurāgaṇāt striyeti strī. prajñāpāramitayā hy āśayānuśayaṃ vijñāya yathāyogam anuṣṭhānāt sarvasattvā anurāgitā bhavantīti prajñaiva strīti kathyate. supuñaleti suṣṭhu puṃsu cañcalā. [ed-m p. 119 - begin after paramā] paramakṛpayānāsravaniruttarānavadhimahāsukhārthaṃ pratisattvamātmasamarpaṇāt, ādikarmikasattvānāṃ sthirīkartum aśakyatvād vā. prajñāniṣprapañcāvabodhaḥ prajñāpāramitā mahāmudreti yāvat. etā niruttarā mudrā aparāś ca vakṣyante trayodaśe. anupacitapuṇyānām aviditatatsvarūpāṇāṃ śrāvakādigotrāṇāṃ bhayahetutvād bhayānakī. tad uktam āryarāhulabhadreṇa—bālānāṃ bhīmadarśaneti. [Rāhulabhadra, Nirvikalpastuti 11b] viparyastasyocchedasamāropeṇa paśyataḥ svargāpavargamārgabahirmukhasya nirayahetutvād ghorā. tad uktam—tvām eva badhyate paśyann [Nirvikalpastuti 15a] iti. kvacid ghoraṣaḍgatīti pāṭhas tadā ghoraḥ saṃsāraḥ. ata ekaiva prajñaiṣām anyeṣāṃ ca saṃsāro nirvāṇaṃ ca. tad uktam āryanāgārjunapadaiḥ—

	bhavasyaiva parijñānaṃ nirvāṇam iti kathyate | 

iti. śrīsampuṭatantre ca—

	analpasaṃkalpatamobhibhūtaṃ prabhañjanonmattataḍiccalaṃ ca |
	rāgādidurvāramalāvaliptaṃ cittaṃ hi saṃsāram uvāca vajrī ||
	prabhāsvaraṃ kalpanayā vimuktaṃ prahīṇarāgādimalapralepam |
	grāhyaṃ na ca grāhakam agrasattvās tad eva nirvāṇavaraṃ jagāda ||
	ataś ca nātaḥ param asti kiṃcid nimittabhūtam bahuduḥkharāśeḥ |
	anantasaukhyodayahetubhūtaṃ mumukṣavo nāsti tataḥ paraṃ ca || [Sampuṭatantra 2.2.26–28 = Prajñopāyaviniścayasiddhi 4.2.22–24]

[ed-m p. 120] iti. anantasukhasamṛddhyā maharddhikī. saṃsāraṃ nirdiśati vikalpetyādi saṃkhyāntam. bhāvābhāvaśāśvatocchedagrāhyagrāhakādivividhakalpanā vikalpaḥ. sa eva saṃtatyā pravartamānaḥ saṃkalpaḥ. udayāstamanam utpādanirodhau. tasyā adhigamopāyaṃ darśayati—avikalpeti. avikalpāni. kānīty āha—hīnetyādi. hīnaṃ sūkṣmapadārthaṃ cittacaittarūpam. utkṛṣṭam ābālaṃ bhāvavyavahāraviṣayatvāt sthūlarūpo bhāvo deha eva. madhyamaṃ dvābhyām anyad ālikālī. tad evaṃ kāyavākcittāni yathāyogaṃ hīnamadhyotkṛṣṭapadair ākhyātāni. anyāni ṣaḍ indriyāṇi. yāni tānīty anena sthirāḥ pṛthivyādayaś calā anye prāṇina ucyante. tad uktaṃ hevajratantre—

	hīnaṃ sūkṣmapadārthaṃ tu utkṛṣṭam bhāvam ucyate |
	madhyamaṃ varjitaṃ dvābhyām anyānīti ṣaḍindriyam ||
	sthiracalaṃ yāni tāni [Hevajratantra 1.8.38–39a]

iti.

etāni hīnādīny avikalpāni nirvikalpasahajamayāni bhāvyamānāni sphuṭībhavanti na tu pādaprasārikayety avikalpaśabdena bhāvanā sūcitā. nanv avikalpabhāvaneti ko 'rthaḥ? mahāsukhenopāyena sarvadharmācintanam eva bhāvanety arthaḥ. tat kiṃ mahāsukhamanasikāro na duṣṭaḥ? nāduṣṭaḥ. tasyāpi sarvajagadavyatiriktatvena jagacchūnyatayā śūnyatvāt. na ca śūnyaṃ cintayituṃ śakyam iti tasyāpi manasikāro duṣṭaḥ. acintanānukūlatvāt tūpadiśyate. yathoktam—

	bhrāntayo 'py upakārāya bhrāntyantaranirākṛteḥ | Ālokamālā 15cd

[ed-m p. 121]

iti. ato nirvikalpasarvadharmaparijñānam eva pāramārthikī prabandhavṛt tau bhāvaneti prajñapyate. tatra yadā yadaiva cetasaḥ sthairyaṃ bhavati tadā tadaiva samāhitayogaḥ. anyadā tv asamāhitayoga eva. ata evotpannakrame mudrāyogam antareṇāpi samāhitayoga upadiśyate, mahāsukhenopāyena sarvadharmāvikalpanenāvasthānāt. siddhis tu mudrāyogād eva. evam iyam ekā svārthasampattyā mahābhāgā parārthasampattyā sarvasattvasukhāvahety upasaṃhāraḥ.

evam iti kramadvayam. hṛṣṭā, utpattikramaśravaṇāt. utphullalocanā, utpannakramaśruter atiharṣeṇa. sacetaseti sacetasaḥ kramadvayanipuṇaniśitabuddhayaḥ. praṇipattīti praṇipatya. yadartham iti yo 'rtho 'bhidheyaḥ. saṃgṛhyeti saṃgṛhītavān.

athetyādi. atra piṇḍārthaḥ. yad bhagavataḥ kapālāc citrasenāhṛdayam āviśramya niḥsṛtaṃ prāg uktaṃ tat pustakaṃ pratibhāsamātratvād idānīṃ vajrapāṇer hastād bhruvā praviśya sagranthārthaṃ dravībhūtaṃ hṛdaya iti. ata eva paścāt saṃgītir upapadyate.

jāpa iti pūrvaṃ sevyamāne. vividhair iti deśakālādibhiḥ. stobhastambhanādikaṃ yad uktaṃ tasminn anuṣṭheye kāle kriyāsu ca niścayaḥ kathaṃ bhavatīti praśnaṃ sphuṭayati—katama ityādi. kaṃ sukhaṃ pālayatīti kapālam eva kāpālaṃ padmam. tribhiḥ koṇaiḥ sambhavatīti trikoṇasambhavam. tayor bhagavadbhagavatīvajrapadmayor yogaḥ. [ed-m p. 122 - begins after adhyāt] adhyātmaṃ tu vajraṃ bodhicittaṃ bhagavān. śukrākāro bhaved bhagavān [Hevajratantra 1.8.50a] iti vacanāt. kāpālaṃ rajaḥ, kapāle bhavatvāt. ata evāha—trikoṇād guhyacakrāt sambhavati. tayor yathopadeśaṃ ratnagarbhe karmacaṇḍālyādinā yogaḥ. paramārthatas tu buddhakāpālayoḥ śūnyatākaruṇayor yogaḥ. tasya tridhāyogasya guhye 'dhyātmani sthitāvadhūtīnāḍī citrasenā mukhyataḥ. tatspharaṇāt tu dvāsaptatināḍīsahasram api citrasenā. avayavārtham āha—citram ity āścaryasya balavaiśāradyāder guṇasya nirāvaraṇasya kārakaṃ sarvākāravaropetā śūnyatā. tad eva senā samūhaḥ sthiracalātmatraidhātukasya mahāsukhajñānasvabhāvatvāt. etena bhagavān yathā śūnyatākaruṇābhinnatvena buddhakapāla ucyate tathā bhagavatī citrasenety api sūcitam. tad eva mahatāṃ yānti yena yad veti yānaṃ hetuphalātmakaṃ mahāyānam. etac cakrata utpadyata ity āha—yoginīti. trividhayogātiśayavattvād yoginyā yoginīsvabhāvā ca nāḍy avadhūtī tasyāḥ sambhavati. uktayogena tad eva divyajñānaṃ yat prāg uktaṃ tadudbhūtaṃ bhāvanayoṣmādikrameṇa mahādivyaṃ phalaṃ vajradharajñānam. sarvasattvasukhāvaham iti sugamam. kvacit sarvabuddhasukhāvaham iti pāṭhas tadā sarveṣāṃ buddhasvabhāvānāṃ skandhādīnāṃ sukhāvaham.

katham evam ity āha—citretyādi. mahādivyam eva. kapāle dharmodayāyām. mantratantravyavasthitam iti oṃ buddhetyādimantraḥ. tantraṃ ca prāg uktam. tābhyāṃ saha vigatamalam avasthitam. athavā mantraḥ śūnyataikarasamahāsukhaṃ sa tantreṇa prabandhena vikalpān avadhūya sthitaṃ yasmiṃs tat tathā. tasya kapālasyaiva trikoṇam [ed-m p. 123]

iti trikoṇakāryatvād ananyopāyajñāpanārtham upacāraḥ. tatreti yatra tad divyajñānaṃ prajñājñānarūpam utpadyate yadāśrayeṇa ca tad evābhyāsāc caturthābhiṣeko bhavati. tatra sthāne sapta pañceti caturdaśābhiṣekāḥ. buddhābhidhāyakā ity akṣobhyādiviśuddhāḥ, tān vakṣyāmaḥ. athavā buddhasambhavam ity asya nirdeśaḥ. saptabuddhābhidhāyakā vipaśyiprabhṛtayas tayaiva bhāvanayā sambhūtā ity arthaḥ.

nānāprayogāḥ śāntikādayo vakṣyamāṇāḥ. āyurvardhanam iti tad eva jñānam āyurvaśitayā. athavā nirmāṇacakragranthau pañcaraśmiyuktaḥ śuklasūkṣmabinduḥ pañcābhiṣekasvabhāvaḥ. saptabuddhābhidhāyakā iti sa binduḥ saptarekhābhir veṣṭayitavyaḥ. tāś ca sūkṣmā jvalantyo vāyor nirgame nirgacchanti, praveśe praviśanti cittena saha bindau. evaṃ bhāvanayā jātaṃ sahajajñānaṃ saptābhiṣekā ity arthaḥ. āyurvardhanam iti praveśanirgamayoḥ prajñopāyasvabhāvajāpena nirodhād ity upadeśaḥ. sarvam etad duravabodhaṃ vinā gurūpadeśenety āha—upadeśamārgam iti. upadeśo mārgaḥ pratītyupāyo yasya tat tathā. upadeśaś cāsmābhir vivṛto vivariṣyate ca.

iti paṇḍitābhayākaraguptakṛtāyām abhayapaddhatyāṃ śrībuddhakapālamahātantraṭīkāyāṃ prathamaḥ paṭalaḥ.


%%%%%%%%%
% ch. 2 %
%%%%%%%%%

[ed-m p. 124] utpattikramaṃ nirdeṣṭuṃ mantrapaṭalam āha—athetyādi. mantramantramūrtimayatvād utpattikramasya, karmaprasarasya cotpattikramāṅgasya mantrasādhyatvāt. mantraṇaṃ mantra āmantraṇaṃ tattvacodanabhāṣaṇam, taddyotakaṃ paṭalaṃ sampravakṣyāmi. yathā mataṃ bhagavato vajradharasya dvādaśasāhasrike buddhakapālamūlatantre.

vajreti samayadravyam, tannivedanamantraḥ. balipūrvakatvāt sarvasiddhīnām āha—oṃ mahākapālavajra ityādi.

indrādayaḥ saparivārāḥ sarvabhūtāḥ, te devatāsyeti sārvabhautikaḥ. balir upahāraviśeṣaḥ tadadhiṣṭhāyako mantraḥ sārvabhautikabalimantraḥ. iha daśasu dikṣu buddhabodhisattvādīn indrādīn saparivārān apramitaprāṇinaś ca saprajñān adhimātraprajñādhikārāj jhaṭiti sampuṭitabhagavadbhagavatīrūpān vyavalokayan baliṃ ca vakṣyamāṇabhāvanayā jhaṭiti vā pāradasadṛśam amṛtamayaṃ sadhūpādikaṃ tebhyo dadyād ity āmnāyaḥ.

taṇḍulaśālim iti raktaśālitaṇḍulam akhaṇḍaṃ śuklagokṣīreṇaiva prakṣālayet.

kumāry avikalāṅgā akṣatā.

atyantaślakṣṇasyeti atyantaślakṣṇam.

[ed-m p. 125] tena taṇḍulena tathā piṣṭena puttalakaṃ herukapratikṛtiṃ kārayet kuryāt svayam.

prājña ity akṣataprajñāyuktaḥ. vajracūḍeneti. vajracūḍam akṣatakumāryāḥ prathamapuṣpasamaye vajrapadmayogajam ubhayabodhicittaṃ tatsvayaṃbhūkusumamiśram. tena saha marditena tatsamabhāgacitāṅgāracūrṇena tat puttalakaṃ lepayet.

buddhakapālayogīti svayaṃ herukātmā sarvaprayogeṣu.

herukākārayogeneti. puttalakaṃ samayasattvaṃ jñānasattvena sahābhinnaṃ sākṣād dherukaṃ bhāvayed evaṃ puttalakasya herukākārayogena. tat puttalakaṃ hastena spṛṣṭvā oṃ mahāvajre ityādikaṃ mantram aṣṭottaraśataṃ japet. udakam iti vajrodakam. tadanu snāpitaputtalakaṃ pūjay itvābhimatāśayena. tena snānodakenātmano mukhaprakṣālanād adṛśyo bhavati sādhakaḥ.

chāraprayogaṃ vaktum āha—tasyetyādi. vavvolakāṣṭhena viddhveti śeṣaḥ. agnineti śmaśānāgninā. tasyeti puttalasya. brahmavajreṇeti. brahmavajram vairocanam. tasyeti puttalasya. āram iti bhasma. aneneti oṃ buddhetyādinā. oṃ buddhetyādi adhiṣṭhaya hrīḥ hūm ityanta eko mantraḥ. pañcapadikaḥ. mantrasyeti mantraḥ.

ayam atra sāmnāyaḥ samudāyārthaḥ. śmaśāne vavvolakāṣṭhasya śuṣkatvacaṃ śuṣkavairocanaṃ caikatra śmaśānāgninā prajvālya tatrāgnau hṛdi nikṣiptavavvolakāṣṭhaṃ tat puttalakaṃ sthāpayitvā tasya puttalasya hṛdaye brahmavajraṃ oṃ buddhetyādipañcapadikamantreṇāṣṭottaraśataṃ juhuyāt. tac ca puttalaṃ dagdhvā chāraṃ kuryāt. tadanv apakvaśarāve [ed-m p. 126]

padmabhājane ca madhye caturdalaṃ padmaṃ likhet tatkarṇikāyāṃ pañcapadikamantrasya citrasenāpadaṃ daleṣv anyapadāni. sarvāṃś ca mantrān

	devo vai mantrarūpeṇa sarvasiddhiprasādhakaḥ | [Siddhaikavīratantra 1.2ab] 

iti siddhaikavīratantravacanāt mantradevatayor abhedena svasvadevatāsvabhāvān bhāvayet. tatas tac chāram apakvaśarāve nidhāyaikaviṃśatidināni pratyahaṃ trikālam aṣṭottaraśataṃ oṃ buddhetyādimantreṇābhimantrayet. tadanu kapāle 'py evam iti cchāraṃ sādhitaṃ bhavatīti. tenety evaṃ sādhitena vajracūḍamarditena. sa eveti śatruḥ. 

dvitīyaṃ prayogam āha—tenaiveti sādhitena. divyatailam avalambitapuruṣatailam, tena saha marditena. tān iti nidhīn tarjayatīti śeṣaḥ. sarve nidhayaḥ.

tṛtīyaṃ prayogam āha—tacāreṇetyādi. sādhitena. mrakṣayitvā tarjanyā tarjayann aṅguṣṭhaṃ bhrāmayitvādhomukhaṃ pātayet.

caturthaprayogam āha—tenaiveti sādhitena tac chāraṃ recitaṃ śodhitavaṅgacūrṇaṃ vajracūḍaṃ ca samabhāgaṃ. kiṃcid iti vaṅgacūrṇād ūnamānam. sarvam etan miśrīkṛtya. vajratuṇḍeti kṛṣṇaśūkaraḥ, tasya raso raktaṃ. vajradaṇḍeti pāṭhe tu vajradaṇḍaraso nṛmūtram. tena raktena mūtreṇa vā bhāvayitvā paścāt palamāne kaṇṭakavedhayogye tāmrabhājane nikṣipya vajratuṇḍarasena nṛmūtreṇa vā pūrayitvā sapta dināni bhāvayet. tadanu mahāpittena manuṣyapittena saha sapta dināni mardayet tatraiva bhājane. tata iti bhājanāt. lohabhājane kāntalohabhājane palamāne kaṇṭakavedhayogye vajratuṇḍarasādinā bhāvanādikaṃ kṛtvā sthāpayed ity arthaḥ.

[ed-m p. 127] sa iti tat tāmrabhājanaṃ lohabhājanam vāgnau nikṣipet sthāpayet. kaścid āha—nirantarāgnijvālanasthānabhūtale nikṣipet prāpya sthāpayet sapta dināni. anyas tv āha—nikṣiped āvartayet. tatas tat tāmrabhājanaṃ hema bhavati lohabhājanaṃ tāram bhavati. apare tv āhuḥ—tata uddhṛtveti yatra kvacid bhājane prathamaṃ vajratuṇḍarasena bhāvayitvā tata uddhṛtya tāmrabhājane lohabhājane bhāvanamardanasthāpanāni kṛtvā tena tāmrabhājanena lohabhājanena vā sahāgnimadhye nikṣiped iti pūrvavat. kiṃ tv āvartanapakṣe vaṅgacūrṇaṃ kāntacūrṇaṃ ca kṣayaṃ nayed iti. sahasretyādi sugamam.

pañcamaprayogam āha—tenaiveti sādhitena. śubhadine prātas tac chāraṃ kumāryāḥ śirasi nikṣipya tāṃ vajracūḍena snāpayet. pañcadhūpena pañcapradīpadhūpena pañcapadikamantraṃ paṭhan dhūpayet.

ṣaṣṭhaṃ prayogam āha. siddhārthaphalaṃ śvetasarṣapaṃ kumārīkapāle ropayitvā tajjaṃ phalam anena mantreṇa pūrvasevāyāṃ kṛtalakṣajāpena saptābhimantritam. tena jyotiṣavidhinā sarvabuddhādhiṣṭhitakumāryāḥ sādhakadārḍhyād anyasyā vā mukhaṃ mantraṃ paṭhaṃs tāḍayet. tataḥ sā kanyā hasati. ekam iti saptakhaḍgānāṃ kumārīmukhān nirgatānām ekaṃ khaḍgaṃ jhaṭiti gṛhītvā khaḍgasiddho bhavati. bhadraka iti bhadrikā prakṛtisthā.

[ed-m p. 128] saptamaprayogam āha—tasyetyādi. chārasya guḍikāṃ hematāraśulbaiḥ krameṇa veṣṭayitvānantaroktamantreṇa kṛtalakṣajāpena saptābhimantritām ūṣmadhūmajvalanānantaraṃ mukhe prakṣipet. atra suvarṇamānaṃ sārdhasaptaraktikādhikamāsakatrayaṃ tārasya sārdhadviraktikādhikamāsakacatuṣṭayaṃ śulbasya pañcaraktikādhikamāsakatrayam. tad uktam—

	sārdhasaptatrayo māsāḥ sārdhadvayaṃ catus tathā |
	pañca guñjās trayo māsā guḍībandhe suniścitāḥ || [source unidentified]

iti.

trailokyasādhanamantra iti purakṣobhamantraḥ. karmānusāreṇa bhagavadbhagavatyor varṇabhedo 'ṣṭame vakṣyate.

iti paṇḍitābhayākaraguptakṛtāyām abhayapaddhatyāṃ srībuddhakapālamahātantraṭīkāyāṃ dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ.


%%%%%%%%%
% ch. 3 %
%%%%%%%%%

[ed-m p. 129] mantram ākhyāya mantramayīṃ mūrtim utpannarūpāṃ ca vaktum āha—athetyādi. devatāpaṭalam iti mantrajātānām utpannarūpāṇāṃ ca devatānāṃ paṭalam.

raṃkāreṇetyādi. maṇḍalacakrabhāvanām ekatra sphuṭaṃ vakṣyāmaḥ.

adhyātmaṃ tu vajrabhūmītyādi. vajrabhūmir nābhiḥ, tanmadhye. utpattikrame ekāraṃ mahātmānaṃ dharmadhātusvabhāvam ekārapariṇataṃ trikoṇaṃ dharmodayaṃ nirmāṇacakraṃ tridhātvātmakaṃ cintayet. tasya trikoṇasya madhye bījam ekāro laṃkāro vā. tatpariṇataṃ pṛthvīmaṇḍalam. hṛdi vaṃkāra oṃkāro vā dharmaś cittaṃ tadātmā. tadudbhavaṃ cakraṃ dharmacakram. sarvanāḍīsvarūpakam ity aṣṭanāḍīsvabhāvam. catuścakranāḍīnām api mahāsukhacittāvyatirekāt tatsvabhāvaṃ.

śirasi yoginīvyavasthitam iti. yoginyo dvātriṃśan nāḍyo viśiṣṭā mahāsukhasthānāt sravantyo bodhicittam āvahantyo 'vasthitā yasmin. divyaṃ mahāsukhacakraṃ tatsvabhāvam. āsāṃ sarvanāḍīsvabhāvadvātriṃśannāḍīnāṃ bodhicittāvahanaṃ sāmānyakarma. viśeṣakarma nāma ca tantrāntarānusāreṇa vaktavyam. tatrāvadhūtī bodhicittam evāvahati. lalanā nābhimūlam avalambamānāśitapītebhyo jaṭharānalapācitebhyo rasam āvahati. tato 'sau raso 'parāparanāḍīsaṃcāreṇa deham abhivyāpnoti. rasanā rasād raktam āvahati. tatas tad api tathaiva deham abhivyāpnoti. sarvāsāṃ copaṃsaṃgrahaḥ—

	nakhadantāvahābhedyā syāt sūkṣmā keśaromagā |
	tvaṅmalāvāhinī divyā vāmā tu piśitāvahā ||

	vaśāvahā vāmanī syāt kūrmajāsthivahā matā |
	vṛkkāvahā bhāvakī syāt sekā syād dhṛdayāvahā || [ed-m p. 130]

	akṣivahā matā doṣā viṣtā pittāvahā smṛtā |
	mātarā phupphusāvahā sarvarī tv antravāhinī ||

	śītā tu pārśvatantau syād ūṣmā syād udarāvahā |
	akṣobhyāvahā lalanā avadhūtī candravāhinī ||

	rasanā raktavahā khyātā viṣṭhāyāṃ pravaṇā matā |
	sīmante kṛṣṇavadanā sāmānyā pūyavāhinī ||

	hetudā śleṣmaṇi proktā viyogā svedavāhinī |
	medasi premaṇī proktā siddhā śokāśruvāhinī ||

	pāvakī tu matā kheṭe sumanā siṃhāṇavāhinī |
	tṛvṛttā tu matā rūpe smṛtā śabde tu kāminī ||

	gandhāvahā tu gehā syāc caṇḍikā rasadāyikā |
	sparśe tu yoginī jñeyā syād dharme māradārikā ||

iti. atra lalanārasanāvadhūtyaś citrasenā. tadaparās tu kramaśo dve dve sumālinīkāpālinībhīmādurjayāḥ. tadaparās tu śubhamekhalādiviṃśatiyoginīsvarūpā jñeyāḥ. māradārikā tv avadhūtīsaṃsṛṣṭaiva rasanāgraṃ yāvan nābher utthitā kālanāḍī nirodhalakṣaṇaṃ dharmaṃ yoginīnām āvahati. sā yoginīsaṃgrahe na praviśati, avidyārūpatvāt tasyāḥ. 

kathaṃ tarhy uktaṃ dvikalpe—dvātriṃśad bodhicittāvahā iti? [Hevajratantra 1.1.13] virodhitvenāvahanāt kālanāḍyā na doṣaḥ. yoginīsvarūpanāḍīnirdeśaprastāve tu tannirdeśaḥ parihārārthaḥ. tadvaśād eva hy ayaṃ loka utpannam api [ed-m p. 131 - after p. 130] mahāsukhamayam etan maṇḍalaṃ nāvalokayati, tadvaśād eva ca mriyate. ata evoktam—sarvaśeṣāṃ tyajed yatnādii iti.

bhagavāṃs tu bodhicittavajraḥ sarvāsām upāyaḥ. etac ca paramārthato bījādyutpattiṃ vinaiva śūnyatākaruṇābhinnaṃ bodhicittarūpam utpannaevoktam—sarvaśeṣāṃ tyajed yatnād iti [Hevajratantra 2.4.25c]. bhagavāṃs tu bodhicittavajraḥ sarvāsām upāyaḥ. etac ca paramārthato bījādyutpattiṃ vinaiva śūnyatākaruṇābhinnaṃ bodhicittarūpam utpannamaṇḍalam uktam.

kalāṣoḍaśabhūṣitam iti kaṇṭhe. kalātra nāḍyaḥ. ṣoḍaśanāḍīyuktaṃ sambhogacakram. nirmāṇaṃ nirmāṇapadmaṃ catuḥṣaṣṭir dalāni nāḍyo yatra tat. evam iti caturṣu cakreṣu nāḍīviṃśatyadhikaśataṃ nāḍīnāṃ viṃśatyuttaraṃ śataṃ bhavati. evaṃ cintayed ity evam utpannamaṇḍalaṃ cintayed bhāvayej japec ca. tatra lalanāyāṃ rasanāyāṃ ca prāṇavāyor ardhārdhapraharādhipatyād ahorātreṇa ṣoḍaśa saṃkrāntayaḥ kaṇṭhe. tatraiva caturmaṇḍalabhedena caturdaṇḍādhipatyāc catuḥṣaṣṭir daṇḍā bhavanti nirmāṇacakre. yathoktaṃ bhagavatā sampuṭāditantreṣv āryanāgārjunapādaiś ca—

	āgneye caiva vāyavye māhendre vāruṇe tathā |
	maṇḍale tasya saṃcāra ūrdhvapārśvarjvadhogatiḥ ||

iti. tatraiva pratyekaṃ prajñopāyarūpamaṇḍaladvayabhogato nāḍīcakrasaṃcārād dvātriṃśan nāḍyo mahāsukhacakre. divārātrivibhāgena [ed-m p. 132] prajñopāyabhedād aṣṭau praharāḥ. tantrāntareṣu ṣaṣṭidaṇḍātmakaṃ yad ahorātram uktaṃ tat ṣaṣṭyuttara śatatrayaśvāsair daṇḍavyavasthānena. iha tu caturmaṇḍalavyavasthayā sārdhasaptatriṃśaduttaraśatatrayaśvāsair daṇḍavyavasthā. ubhayatrāpi tv ahorātreṇa ṣaṭśatādhikaikaviṃśatiśvāsasahasrāṇi bhavantīty aviśeṣaḥ. evaṃ cotpannakramāpekṣayā jāpo 'py utpannaḥ sūcitaḥ. tad uktam—

	ayute dve sahasraṃ ca ṣaṭ śatāni tathaiva ca |
	ahorātreṇa yogīndro japasaṃkhyāṃ karoti ca || [Pañcakrama 1.54]

iti. japtavidyasya cetasaḥ sthairye mahāsukhamayam utpannamaṇḍalam āmukhībhavati. prājña ity adhimātraprajña utpannamaṇḍalabhāvanānipuṇaḥ. vajradehe śūnyataikarasamahāsukhamayadehe. ata eva svaparayor mahāmudrāsiddhiyogyatvān mahātmā.

tatreti dharmacakre. utpattikrame vaṃjanitaṃ varuṇamaṇḍalam. sarvanāḍīmaṇḍalaṃ varuṇamaṇḍalaṃ līyata iti hṛdaṣṭanāḍīnām eva spharaṇam anyan nāḍīcakram ataḥ sarvanāḍīmaṇḍalaṃ varuṇamaṇḍalaṃ śliṣyati.

punar ityādi. nirmāṇacakrasyādho raktamakārajaṃ raṃkārajaṃ vā trikoṇam agnimaṇḍalaṃ jvalac chliṣyan nirmāṇanāḍīcakre agner adho yākārajaṃ yaṃkārajaṃ vā vāyumaṇḍalam.

sarvanāḍīcalanarūpam iti. tad vāyumaṇḍalam agniṃ prajvālayat sarvanāḍīsthitaṃ bodhicittaṃ cālayati. līyamānacakravid iti. līyamānasya cakre vid vedanam. taccālitabodhicittaṃ līyate vāyucakre tadā sahajasukhavedanaṃ bhavati. sarve te līyamānena yogī tatra madhyasthita iti. tatra sahajasukhavittau sarve skandhādayo līyamānāḥ. yogī cittaṃ tad api tasyāṃ tādātmyena sthitam. candram iti bodhicittam. mahāsukhacakre uṣṇīṣaṃ [ed-m p. 133] yāvat. bhāskaraṃ rajo nirmāṇacakrasyādhaḥ. hūṃ āḥ iti. kvacit hūṃ aṃ iti pāṭhaḥ. hūṃkāraṃ nīlam dharmacakre. āḥkāram aṃkāraṃ vā raktaṃ nirmāṇacakre. sambhogacakre raktam oṃkāraṃ tantrāntarokteḥ.

kakārahakārabhūṣitam iti. kakāraś cāsau hakāraś ca bhūṣitaś ca. kam mahāsukhaṃ tatsvabhāvo mahāsukhacakre hakāro mastakaśūnyo 'nāhato 'rdhacandrabindubhūṣitaḥ śubhras taṃ cintayet. kakāraṃ tu hakāralīyamānam iti. mahāsukham anāhate miśrībhūtam abhinnam iti yāvat. hahūṃabhinnakam iti. yādṛśaḥ svabhāvo 'nāhatasya tādṛśo hūṃkārasya. ubhayam ubhayasvabhāvam ity arthaḥ. yathā hi tatsukhaṃ kāminī smṛtam iti [Hevajratantra 1.8.50b] vacanāt kaṃ prajñā ha upāyaḥ, tayor abhedas tathā sukhātmā hakāraḥ prajñā ūṃkārayogāt. ha hūṃ ity akṣaradvayaṃ militaṃ hūṃkāraṃ cittam upāya iti prajñopāyayor abhedaḥ. hūṃkāraraśmaya iti vāyunā tejaścaṇḍālīraśmicoditā nirgatā mahāsukhacakraṃ tatra śaśinaṃ saṃcodya tena śaśinā vikalpasaṃtāpaśamanāc chiśiropamena kakāramahāsukhena sūryeṇa ca rajasā haṃoṃbhyāṃ ca saha dravībhūya hūṃkāre viśrāmyanti. tato hūṃkāro 'pi dravībhūya nirmāṇabīje viśrāmyati. tac ca candrasūryamaṇḍaladvaye maṇḍaladvayaṃ ca miśrībhūya sūryeti rajomaṇḍalam evodbhūtaṃ bindurūpaṃ dṛśyate śukraṃ tv anudbhūtam.

punaḥ hūṃkāraraśmaya iti. hūṃkāradravabindo raśmirekhā sarvanāḍīcakraṃ spṛśati. bījam iti mahāsukhotpatter bindurūpam. iti binduyoga uktaḥ. utpannamaṇḍalabhāvanāyāṃ tu bījādyutpattiṃ vinā rajorūpacaṇḍāly [ed-m p. 134] api nisargato jvalati. śaśī ca taduddīpitaḥ sutarāṃ sravati. tadāpyāyitā ca caṇḍālī sutarāṃ jvalati. śaśī ca taduttāpito nitarāṃ sravatīty āntara candrasūryasamāgamo 'nucchinno mahāsukhamayaḥ skandhadhātvādisamāropam abhibhavan prabhavati. ye tv evam anadhimuktās te yathoktajapena prāṇāyāmādhipatyaprāptyāpānavāyum ākuñchya nābhimaṇḍale mahāmudrām avalambya vāyuṃ nivārayantaś caṇḍālīṃ jvalayanti. tatas tathaiva mahāsukham āvirbhavati. evam asamarthas tu tathaiva nābhimaṇḍale vāyuṃ niruddham adhimucyāvasthita ucchvāsodgame ṛjurekhāṃ caṇḍālīrūpeṇa bhagavatīṃ jvalantīm adhimucya mahāsukhasthānam anuprāptāṃ niḥśvāsapraveśe haṃkāraśaśisravadbindurūpeṇa tām avalambamāno mahāsukhamayo nābhimaṇḍalam āgamyānālambano bhavet. evaṃ yāvat prāṇanirodham avasthitas tathaiva śvāsodgamapraveśayoḥ punaḥ punar anutiṣṭhet.

yaḥ punaḥ prāṇodgamapraveśanirūpaṇāśaktaḥ so 'dhimuktimātreṇaiva sampādayati. 

utpattikramabhāvakas tu tatpūrvakam eva sakalam idaṃ yathābalam avalambeta.

vistararucis tu sakalayoginīcakrasvarūpamahāmudrātmakacitrasenayā bhagavatyā caṇḍālīrūpeṇa jvalantyā daśadigvisarpiṇyā mahārāgānalaprabhayā saṃcoditān mahārāgānuraktān sarvatathāgatān mahāsukhacakrapraviṣṭān dṛṣṭvā tathaiva sarvam anutiṣṭhet.

evam asya buddhādhiṣṭhānaṃ ca sampadyata iti caṇḍālīprabhedopadeśāḥ. sarvaṃ cedaṃ sadgurusamāmnātaṃ vyākhyātam.

tenaiveti sārdreṇa nṛtantuneti śeṣaḥ.

evaṃ pāramiteti prajñāpāramitāsvabhāvā. bhagavāṃs tu [ed-m p. 135 - after *sva] mahākaruṇāsvabhāvaḥ. tasyāṅgajaraśmaya iti tasya bhagavato dehajacaṇḍālīraśmayaḥ tena sraveṇeti dharmacakrabījasya snāpanasamaye dharmacakrasyāṣṭanāḍīsvabhāvā yoginyo bahiḥ spharitvety arthaḥ. pañcasugandheti pañcāmṛtāni. puṣpaṃ strīrajaḥ. dhūpo rāgavajriṇīrāgeṇa jvalitacaṇḍālīdīpasya. niṣpattivīram iti vīrasya niṣpattiṃ dṛṣṭvā sravati prāgvat. sāhārapallavaḥ sahakārapallavaḥ.

padārthayanta iti prārthyante. sekeneti seko nirmalīkaraṇam. vidur viduṣyo viditottāraṇopāyāḥ.

aputrasyetyādi yathā putre mṛte gṛhe putreṇa śūnyatā tathā sekarahite puṃsi sarvajñajñānena rahitatā.

yathā sarvasaṃyoge 'pi tantrīṃ vinā vīṇā na vādyate, tato na dhvaniḥ sidhyati.

yāvad buddhair na hīyate na tyājyate narakam. etena sarveṣām abhiṣekāṇām avaśyagrāhyatām āha. heruke bhūte iti herukarūpeṇa bhāvanayā niṣpannena kiṃ prayojanam, sekaṃ vinā buddhatvasyābhāvāt. puṇyamātraṃ tu syād ity arthaḥ.

sa iti tasya. bāhyaguhyety upalakṣaṇāt prajñācaturthābhiṣekāv api jñeyau.

iti paṇḍitābhayākaraguptakṛtāyām abhayapaddhatyāṃ śrībuddhakapālamahātantraṭīkāyāṃ tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ.


