%%%%%%%%%

[ed-m p. 136] gāruḍaṃ vaktum āha—athetyādi. asmākaṃ vayam. raśminā prathamapaṭale sphāritamantraraśminā. hṛdayaraśmaya iti citrasenāyā hṛdraśmayo nāgānām āpyāyanaṃ kṛtvāgatya citrasenāyā hṛdi praviṣṭāḥ. ājñaptā iti vayam. devīti devi. āheti citrasenā nāgān adhiṣṭhāya tanmukhena viṣatattvaṃ nirdeṣṭuṃ pañca praśnān.

tīrthikādigāruḍam ityādau hariharādīnāṃ bhagavato vajradharasya ca gāruḍaṃ mantrauṣadhisamādhiviśeṣaḥ. kīdṛśaṃ matam? jñānaṃ ca tat sambhavatīti sambhavaṃ ca jñānasambhavaṃ kīdṛśam. napuṃsakatvaṃ viśeṣaṇaparatā cārṣatvāt. viṣasyeti viṣam. katham iti prabhedapraśnaḥ. āhur iti nāgāḥ.

harītyādi tīrthikapakṣe pañcamapraśnavisarjanam. hariharādayo viparyastabuddhayo vastutattvānabhijñās teṣāṃ mate. daṃṣṭrā daṣṭo viṣaṃ maraṇaṃ ca pāramārthikam asti. ataḥ sattvās tattvājñānād viṣadoṣair bādhyante mriyante gāruḍenāpi jīvayituṃ na śakyante. evaṃ kāladaṣṭaṃ vadantīti.

	bāṇapakṣartuvahnyaśvayugacandrādribhir divā |
	ṣaḍvedabhujasaptīṣuguṇalakṣmīnagair niśi ||

ity ādityādivāreṣu yathākramam ardhapraharāḥ kālaḥ, tatra daṣṭam apratikriyaṃ vadantīti tṛtīyapraśnavisarjanam.

prathamapraśnaṃ visṛjanti—sarpasyetyādi. kāladaṣṭatvābhāve haratīti haraṃ gāruḍaṃ hariharādikṛtaṃ sarpaviṣābhibhavanopāyo 'sti. tathā sati [ed-m p. 137] 

daṣṭasya sarpaviṣaṃ nāsti. kāladaṣṭatve gāruḍābhāve sarpair ityādyupasaṃhāraḥ.

maharddhikā gāruḍakaraṇāt. 

bhagavatpakṣe dvitīyapraśnam uttaranti—bhagavān ityādi. heyopādeyaśāsanāc chāstā.
hariharādir api śāstā tadbhaktair ucyata ity āha—śūnyatāvādīti.

	parokṣopeyataddhetos tadākhyānaṃ hi duṣkaram || [Pramāṇavārttika, pramāṇasiddhi 132cd]

iti nyāyād adhigatasamastavastutattvaḥ kṛpāpāratantryād vineyānāṃ śūnyatātma tattvaṃ vadati. niścayaṃ niścitatvaṃ kriyāviśeṣaṇam. śaṃkarādayaḥ svayam aniścitatattvāḥ pareṣām api tanniścayaṃ na vadantīti bhāvaḥ. taddeśitaśūnyatāsamādhir eva niruttaraṃ viṣaśamanam iti prathamapraśnavisarjanam. śūnyeṣv iti. ekānekasvabhāvavirahān niḥsvabhāveṣu.

	yaḥ pratītyasamutpādaḥ śūnyatā saiva te matā | [Lokātītastava 22ab]

iti. sarvadharmeṣu skandhadhātvāyataneṣu sarpo daṃṣṭrā viṣaṃ ca katham? nāsty evaivaṃ śūnyatāyā viṣatattvasya niścayena viṣam avaśyaṃ vinaśyatīty arthaḥ.

ata eva tṛtīyapraśne visarjanaṃ katham ityādi. sarvatra kiṃ kṣepe. [Aṣṭādhyāyī 2.1.64]

pañcamapraśne uttaraṃ daṣṭenetyādi. śūnyatāyā aniścayān mriyante. atas teṣāṃ śūnyatāyā vādena deśanayā niścayaṃ vadati bhagavān.

idānīṃ yeṣām āntaraṃ viṣaṃ nāsti teṣāṃ sarpādiviṣam apīti vaktum āha—rāgetyādi. rāgaḥ sāsrave vastuny āsaṅgaḥ. moho 'vidyā [ed-m p. 138 - begins after bhāvā] bhāvābhāvādyabhiniveśaḥ. mahāyaśe iti citrasenāsambodhanam. prākṛtaviṣayā iti. prakṛtir atrāvidyā, tayādhyāropitāḥ prākṛtāḥ. prakṛtiviṣayasunirmalam iti. prakṛtir iha śūnyatā, tayā rūpādipañcaviṣayāś cittaviṭhapitāḥ suṣṭhu savāsanaṃ nirmūlitā malā rāgādayaḥ śūnyatāsvabhāvā yeṣāṃ te tathā. bahutva ekavacanam ārṣatvāt. nairmalyaṃ caiṣāṃ cittanairmalyāt. cittaṃ ca prakṛtinirmalam. tad uktaṃ pramāṇavārttike—

	prabhāsvaram idaṃ cittaṃ prakṛtyāgantavo malāḥ || [Pramāṇavārttika, pramāṇasiddhi 208]

iti. prakṛte yojayati—maletyādi. ayam arthaḥ—rāgādir evāntaraṃ viṣam. tad uktaṃ bhagavatā—

	rāgo dveṣaś ca mohaś ca ete loke trayo viṣāḥ || [Quoted in Sutaka ed. p. 464. Wedemeyer notes the verse is also found in Mahāmāyūrīvidyārājñī]

iti. te ca cittasyaivāgantusvabhāvāḥ. tataś cittam eva mūḍhaṃ raktaṃ dviṣṭaṃ vāntaraṃ viṣaṃ puṇyajñānasambhārajīvitavighātāt. taccittavaśād viṣayasvarūpam api viṣam. yadā tu cittaṃ śūnyatākaruṇābhinnasvabhāvaṃ nairmalyān nirviṣaṃ niścitaṃ tadā viṣayasvarūpam api malarahitaṃ kathaṃ naiva viṣam. evaṃ nyāyena sthāvaraviṣādibhakṣaṇādau tattvādhimokṣān na  bādheti sūcitam. tad uktaṃ hevajratantre dṛṣṭāntatvena—

	ghummaï garalaha bhakkhaṇeṃ jo ṇicceaṇa loa |
	mohavivajjia tantamaṇu tasu para tuṭṭaï soa || [Hevajratantra 2.4.71] [ed-m p. 139]

iti. atra mohavivarjito viṣatattvaparijñānāt. tantamaṇu viṣatattvādhimokṣamanāḥ. soa śokaḥ. āntaraviṣanāśanaṃ ca tatra dārṣṭāntikatvenoktam.

	tathā nirvṛtyupāyajñā hevajre sukṛtaśramāḥ |
	avidyādyair na bādhyante na ca mohādibandhanaiḥ || [Hevajratantra 2.4.7]

iti. atra hevajra iti śūnyatāmahāsukhānālambanamahākaruṇābhinnajñāne. avidyādyair dvādaśabhir aṅgair mohādibhiḥ kleśaiś ca.

evam āntaraviṣarahitasya bāhyaviṣam api na bādhata ity āha—sarpo 'pīti.

caturthapraśnaṃ visṛjanti—prākṛtaviṣaṃ sarpaviṣadoṣam eva ceti. prakṛtir avidyā tadāropād utpannaṃ prākṛtaṃ viṣam. sarpasyedaṃ sarpam, aṇi vṛddhyabhāvāt. viṣayaviṣaṃ ceti dvayam api kiṃ kariṣyatīti sambandhaḥ. 

tīrthikapakṣe dvitīyapraśnavisarjanam—devā viṣayāvṛtā iti. śaṃkarādayo viṣayeṣu tiraskṛtattvajñānāḥ kleśajñeyāvaraṇaiḥ. atas teṣām āntaraṃ bāhyaṃ ca viṣam asti. kiṃ tu maharddhikatvena gāruḍaṃ kurvanti, kāladaṣṭaṃ tv asādhyaṃ vadanti. ata eva vakṣyati—nirbuddhimaharddhikā iti. [ed-m p. 140 - begins after bha]bha 

gavāṃs tu buddhakapālo nirmūlitasavāsanasarvāvaraṇaḥ kāmān bhuṅkte na ca bādhyata iti pratipādayati—viṣayetyādi. tathā ghaṭamānā api buddhakapālayoginaḥ sarvaviṣayān bhuñjate na ca lipyante buddhakapālayogād ity āha—buddhetyādi.

sarvopalakṣaṇatayopasaṃharanti—kāladaṣṭam. tata iti buddhakapālayogāt.

evaṃ pāramārthikaṃ gāruḍam uktvā sāṃvṛtam āhuḥ—śālikītyādi.

yatāḥ saṃyatā bhavanty atra śālikīkaraṇe. tīrthikāḥ kāladaṣṭam asādhyaṃ vadanti na bhagavān iti bhāvaḥ.

evam uktvā nāgāś citrasenāṃ praṇipatya svasvasthāneṣu gatā ity āha saṃgītikāraḥ—īdṛśam ityādi.

utprekṣeti svarūpanirūpaṇam. oṃ iti kāyavākcittaṃ śūnyatā naiḥsvābhāvyaṃ jñānaṃ mahākaruṇā tat trayam abhedyatvād vajrasvabhāvam ātmā svabhāvo yasya so 'ham. yathaivam ahaṃ tathā sakalam ity āha—sunnāsunnam iti. śūnyaṃ svarūpavirahāt. aśūnyaṃ tathāpy anabhilapyatvād dvayavirahitena rūpeṇāvasthānāt.

pañcavitastīti ṣaṣṭyaṅgulam. mūlasūtrābhyantaraṃ caturasraṃ maṇḍalam. vṛttaṃ triṃśadaṅgulam. tatraiva nīlakuliśāvalīvalayitam aṣṭadalakamalaṃ triṃśadaṅgulam.

tantrāntareṣu bhuvaḥ khananādinā śalyoddharaṇādiśodhanam uktam. iha tv adhimātratantratvād dhastena spṛṣṭvāṣṭottaraśatamantrajāpān maṇḍalabhūmiṃ vakṣyamāṇahomakuṇḍabhūmiṃ ca śodhayed ity āha—bhūmītyādi. atra gāruḍādhikāramaṇḍale devatāvedīpaṭṭī na kartavyety āha—vediketyādi. raktarajeneti caturdikṣu sarvaṃ maṇḍalasthānaṃ raktavarṇenaiva rajasā pūrayet. yathā samājādau vairocanādidigbhedena bhūmer varṇabhedas tathānety āha—anyetyādi. anyat pañcarekhādikaṃ pañcavarṇarajobhir [ed-m p. 141 - after yothāyo] yathāyogaṃ kurtyāt. balidānabhūṣodhanasūtramantraṇasūtraṇarajaḥpātādikaṃ herukayogavatā guruṇā kartavyam.

kalaśā ity akālamūlā lambodarauṣṭhā uccagrīvāḥ. koṇe aiśānāgneyādau. caturṣu kalaśeṣu yathāsaṃkhyaṃ catvāri cihnāni. vijayakalaśas tu pañcamo nāyakasyātrānukto 'pi tantrāntaranyāyāt pūrvadvāre kiṃciddakṣiṇe pratipattavyaḥ. sa evātra sārvakarmikaḥ. tatra cihnaṃ dharmodayamadhye ḍamaruḥ. ḍamarūpari vajraṃ padmaṃ ca.

ācāryo buddhakapālayogavān bhavet. katham ity āha—padmetyādi. viśvapadmavaraṭake. paścād ityādi. ācāryaḥ svayam aṣṭadevīparivṛtaherukātmā jñānasattvapraveśānantaram ātmānam abhiṣecayet. herukāṅgajaraśmīti hṛdaṣṭanāḍībhyaḥ spharitasaraśmikāṣṭadevībhis tathāgatān sparśayed acāryaḥ. tā devya āgatatathāgatāstathāgataraśmiviniḥsṛtadevyaś ca herukam aṣṭayoginīś ca snāpayanti. mukuṭinam iti. mukuṭī heruko yoginībhiḥ saha. tā api mukuṭinya ity arthaḥ.

maṇḍalaniṣpattim iti. evaṃ svayaṃ herukātmā niṣpanne rajomaṇḍale jhagiti samayasattvaṃ jñānasattvam abhiṣekaṃ mudraṇaṃ ca vibhāvya maṇḍalasādhanāt.

balim iti nāgebhyaḥ.

dīpam iti madhughṛtamatsyatailasugandhitailadīpāṃś caturo maṇḍalasamīpe dāpayet. āmranālikerakadalīkapitthaphalāni catvāri. śāṭakatrayaṃ paridhānaprāvaraṇaśiroveṣṭanāni. 

yoginīṃ svayaṃ ḍhaukitāṃ guruprajñām. vīraṃ gurum.

cakraṃ gaṇamelakam.

samayasāraikacitteneti samayasāro bhagavān.

[ed-m p. 142] ātmaśaṅkānivāraṇam iti. śaṅkayā viṣaṃ prabhavati niḥśaṅkasya nety arthaḥ.

sthāvaraṃ śṛṅgīviṣādikam. jaṅgamaṃ sarpādīnām. aṅgajaṃ vicoḍikādikam. kṛtrimaṃ samamadhughṛtādikam.caturvidhaṃ viṣaṃ nirviṣaṃ karomi.

kāṣṭham iti dantakāṣṭham. śiṣyaṃ herukamūrtiṃ bhāvayet.

kaṇṭha ity ācāryasya śiṣyasya ca. haste ca vāme. candra iti kaṇṭhasthe hastasthe ca.

bhāvanāśaktyeti herukarūpacandrādikaṃ bhāvayaṃs tathā bhāvitaṃ hastaṃ śiṣyaśirasi dattvā mantraṃ paṭhet.

kumbham iti kumbhamānam. duḥsaheti duḥkham.

gāruḍetyādi. yadā tv ayaṃ sattvo gāruḍaṃ pratipatsyate tadāsmākaṃ na kvacit paritrāṇāyāśrayatvena gatir bhaviṣyati.

anantareṇety adhivāsanānantaram. anudatta iti kartari vartamāne kta ārṣatvāt. anukrameṇa dadyād ity arthaḥ.

śaṅkhetyādi. ekasyāṃ yantrikāyāṃ śaṅkhaṃ dvitīyāyāṃ tāmrabhājanam. kalaśaṃ vijayakalaśam  aparacatuḥkalaśāṃś ca. aṣṭayoginī dravībhūyeti. bhagavatā saha maṇḍale sthitadevatābhiḥ saha tādātmyena sthitāḥ. samayajñānasattvayoś caikarasībhāva eva maṇḍalapratiṣṭhāpanam.

kalaśe vijayakalaśe bhagavantam aṣṭadevīś ca drutāḥ praviṣṭāḥ. anyakalaśeṣu yathāyogaṃ devīś cintayet.

udakam iti vijayakalaśādyudakaṃ katipayaṃ tāmrabhājane śaṅkhe ca sthāpayet.

udakeneti tāmrodakena tadanu śaṅkhodakena stokena.

uccārayet pāṭhayed ācāryaḥ śiṣyam. pūjāpayed guruḥ śiṣyam.

śiṣya iti spheṭitāndhapaṭe. punar iti secanārthaṃ grahaṇāpekṣayā. sa [ed-m p. 143] vajrahastadvayena pibāvayet herukamantraṃ paṭhan vāratrayaṃ tāmrajalamiśraṃ śaṃkhajalam. jalapānasyānuśaṃsaṃ vakṣyati.

ayam atra kramaḥ. ācāryo yathāvad abhiṣikto gurubhir anujñātas trisamādhikuśalo herukātmā japtavidyo nirantaraṃ ciraṃ suparīkṣitān prārthayamānān śiṣyān abhiṣektukāmaḥ prathamaṃ rājacaurādisarvopadravarahite maṇḍalagṛhādau yathāvidhi vartite rajomaṇḍale paṭādimaṇḍale vā yathoktadīpaphalādipañcopacārapūjite nāgārthaṃ ḍhaukitakṣīre kalaśān adhivāsayet. tatra vijayakalaśaṃ dharmodayamadhyasthitaḍamaruvajrapadmāṅkitaṃ gandhodakaparipūrṇaṃ suvarṇarajatarājāvarttamuktāpravālaiḥ pañcaratnair yavagodhūmatilamāṣadhānyaiḥ pañcavrīhibhir bṛhatīkaṇṭakārīśvetāparājitāsitadaṇḍotpalāsahadevābhiḥ pañcauṣadhībhir yuktamadhyaṃ sahakārapallavālaṃkṛtamukhaṃ raktavastraveṣṭitagrīvaṃ sragviṇaṃ sragbaddhavajramūrdhānam uparisthitakṣīrapūrṇabhājanam antar jhaṭityutpannasamayasattvayuktaṃ kṛtvā sūryavajramuṣṭisthahūṃbījamarīcibhir akaniṣṭhād bhagavantam aṣṭayoginīparivṛtam ānīya hṛdayamantreṇārghaṃ saptaśaḥ parijapya oṃ herukavajra arghaṃ pratīccha hūṃ ity anena dattvā tanmadhye praveśya samayasattvena sahaikībhūya mahārāgeṇa dravībhūya mahāsukhamayabodhicittarūpeṇa tajjalaṃ vicintya vāmamuṣṭinā vajrāsaktakusumasrajaṃ gṛhītvā hṛdayamantreṇāṣṭottaraśatenābhimantrayet. aparamāṇḍaleya [ed-m p. 144] kalaśān gandhodakaparipūrṇān sahakārapallavānvitān raktavastraveṣṭitagrīvān sragviṇo yathāsaṃkhyaṃ kapālakhaṭvāṅgakarttiḍamaru cihnāṅkitān antaḥsamayadevyabhinnajñānadevīdravajalayuktān pratyekaṃ devībījamantreṇāṣṭottaraśatābhimantritān kuryāt.

tatra kapālāṅkite śauṇḍinīcitrasene. khaṭvāṅgāṅke bhūtinīsaubhadre. karttyaṅke caturbhujāpātālavāsinyau. ḍamarucihnite ākāśavāsinīkāminyau. hūṃ oṃ hūṃ svaḥ hūṃ khaṃ hūṃ hūṃ bījāni yathākramam āsām. tadanu samudāyena puṣpadhūpādibhiḥ sampūjya baliṃ ca dattvā kamalakuliśetyādinā stutipuraḥsaraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ vādayitvā praṇamed iti. kalaśādhivāsanāvidher anantaram ācāryaḥ śiṣyadattatripaṭādibhūṣaṇaḥ saprajñaḥ kṛtakelimālīko maṇḍalasthānād bahir āsane niṣaṇṇaḥ śiṣyaṃ kṛtatrimaṇḍalaṃ gṛhītapuṣpasrajaṃ pṛthivyām āropitajānuṃ kṛtāñjaliṃ gāruḍādibhavyaṃ buddhyā svaśarīre praveśya vajranirgataṃ prajñāpadmasthitaṃ hṛdbījasamānītāvadhūtīpraviṣṭatathāgatadravair abhiṣiktaṃ herukarūpaṃ maṇḍalapūrvadvāre niṣādya

	he bhagavan guruḥ śāstā sattvārthaikatatparaḥ |
	icchāmi gāruḍaṃ divyaṃ śālikākaraṇayogajam ||

	karomi sattvārthaṃ divyaṃ kāladaṣṭanivāraṇam |
	tan me brūhi mahāśāstā buddhakāpālayoginaḥ ||

ity anena praveśaṃ yācayitvā

	ratnatrayaṃ me śaraṇaṃ sarvaṃ pratidiśāmy agham |
	anumode jagatpuṇyaṃ buddhabodhau dadhe manaḥ ||

[ed-m p. 145] iti triḥ pāṭhayitvā hṛdayamantreṇārakṣya tasya hṛdi kṛṣṇavajravaraṭake hūṃ kaṇṭhe raktapadme āḥ śirasi śubhracakre oṃ ity akṣarāṇi kṛṣṇaraktasitāni cintayet. tata utthāya gandhodakavajrayuktayā dakṣiṇamuṣṭyā hūṃ āḥ oṃ iti paṭhan hṛtkaṇṭhaśirāṃsi saṃspṛśya śirasi puṣpam agre dhūpaṃ dīpaṃ ca hṛdi gandhaṃ dadyāt. tadanv aśvatthādidantakāṣṭham akhaṇḍitāgram avakrādikaṃ dvādaśāṅgulapramāṇaṃ puṣpamālāveṣṭitāgraṃ sugandhajalakṣālitaṃ dantakāṣṭhamantreṇa saptābhimantritaṃ dadyād udaṅmukhaḥ. śiṣyaś ca gocarmamātraliptabhūmāv agreṇa khāditvā pūrvamukha udaṅmukho vordhvaṃ paśyan nirapekṣaṃ kṣipet. paścād ācamanārthaṃ gandhāmbuculukatrayapānam oṃ hrīḥ viśuddhadharma sarvapāpāni cāsya viśodhaya sarvavikalpān apanaya hūṃ ity anena mantreṇa kārayet. tadanv ācāryaḥ svasya gandhopalipte puṣpaveṣṭite vāmahaste kaṇṭhe ca candramaṇḍalaṃ tadraśmibhir daśadigbuddhān ānīya mahārāgeṇa dravībhūya candradvaye praviṣṭāṃś cintayet. tatas taṃ hastaṃ śiṣyaśirasi dattvādhivāsanāmantraṃ saptavārān paṭhet. tatas te kaṇṭhasthā hastasthāś ca buddhāḥ saha candreṇa śiṣyakāye praviśyād hiṣṭhānaṃ kurvantīti vicintyārakṣya śiṣyaṃ tasya hṛdayamantrābhimantritakuśān āstīrya śayanārtham upadhānārthaṃ ca dadyāt. ācāryas tu maṇḍalagṛhaṃ praviśya bhāvanāṃ japaṃ ca kuryāt.

iti śiṣyādhivāsanavidhānaṃ kṛtvā prabhāte baliṃ dattvā maṇḍalagṛhān niṣkramya śiṣyaṃ svapnaṃ pṛṣṭvā hṛdayamantreṇārakṣya maṇḍalagṛhe yathāvibhavaṃ pūjāṃ kṛtvā devatācakraṃ sākṣāt tatra sthitam adhimucya nāyakaṃ svabuddhyā gurūkṛtya [ed-m p. 146 - after *prave] vakṣyamāṇaśiṣyapraveśavidhinā svayam ādau maṇḍale praviśyābhiṣekaparyantam ātmanaḥ kulādhipena niṣpādya tata eva sarvācāryakarmasv anujñāṃ prāpya satyādhiṣṭhānaṃ kuryāt.

	yena satyena saj jñānaṃ prajñopāyātma maṇḍalam |
	tena satyena me nātha kāmāṃs tvaṃ paripūraya ||

	pratibimbasamā dharmā acchāḥ  śuddhā hy anāvilāḥ |
	agrāhyā anabhilāpyāś ca hetukarmasamudbhavāḥ ||

	tathatātattvaniryātā iti satyena maṇḍalam |
	pratibimbaṃ sphuṭaṃ śiṣyāḥ sarve paśyantv akalmaṣāḥ ||

iti. tadanu śiṣyaṃ snāpayitvā sugandhādinā pavitrībhūtam āraktavastraparidhānottarīyam āraktabaddhāndhapaṭaṃ śrīherukarūpeṇālambitam āḥ khaṃ vīra hūṃ iti mantreṇa gṛhītapuṣpaṃ kāṇḍapaṭād bahir dattadakṣiṇaṃ sārvakarmikakalaśajalābhyukṣitaṃ hūṃkāreṇa maṇḍalapūrvadvāre vyavasthāpitaṃ maṇḍalapraveśārthaṃ pṛcchet. kas tvaṃ bhor iti. tena vaktavyam—jinaputro 'ham iti. tato 'sya oṃ sarvayogacittam utpādayāmīty anena bodhicittam utpādya sapuṣpaṃ vajraṃ hṛdi oṃ surate samayas tvaṃ hoḥ sidhya vajra yathāsukham iti paṭhan pratiṣṭhāpayet. tataḥ śirasi vajraṃ saṃsthāpya brūyāt. 

	ayaṃ te samayo vajraṃ mūrdhānaṃ sphālayed yadi |
	tvam imaṃ kasyacid brūyāḥ

[ed-m p. 147] tato hṛdaye vajraṃ sthāpayitavyaṃ vadet.

	oṃ vajrasattvaḥ svayaṃ te 'dya hṛdaye samavasthitaḥ |
	nirbhidya tatkṣaṇaṃ yāyād yadi brūyā imaṃ nayam ||

ity anena śapathaṃ kārayitvā padmabhājanagatatryakṣarādhiṣṭhitapañcāmṛtamiśraṃ kalaśoparisthitaṃ kṣīram oṃ pañcāmṛtodaka ṭhaḥ hūṃ ity anena saptajaptam 

	idaṃ te nārakaṃ vāri samayātikramād dahet |
	samayasaṃrakṣaṇāt siddhiḥ piba vajrāmṛtodakam ||

iti paṭhan pāyayet. na ca tvayāham avamantavyo mā te samayo vyathen narakādigatiś ca syād ity uktvā bhagavati kṛtāñjaliḥ

	ity ayaṃ maṇḍale samyag mayā śiṣyaḥ praveśitaḥ |
	yathā puṇyaṃ tathāsyāstu devatānāṃ kulakramaḥ ||

	yādṛk siddhir bhaved asya gotre yasmiṃś ca bhājanam |
	yādṛk puṇyānubhāvaś ca tādṛg asyāstu maṇḍale ||

iti satyādhiṣṭhānaṃ kṛtvā pañcākṣareṇa pūrvagṛhītapuṣpaṃ trāṃkārādhiṣṭhitaṃ hūṃkāreṇa maṇḍalamadhye kṣepayan oṃ herukavajra puṣpaṃ pratīccha hūṃ iti pāṭhayet. tatkṣiptaṃ puṣpaṃ śiṣyaśirasi badhnan pratigṛhṇa tvam imaṃ mahābaleti paṭhet. tadanu śiṣyasya hṛccandre 'dhipatiṃ lalāṭe rephaṃ netradvaye oṃkāradvayaṃ vibhāvya

	oṃ vajrasattvaḥ svayaṃ te 'dya cakṣurudghāṭanatatparaḥ |
	udghāṭayati sarvākṣo vajracakṣur anuttaram ||

iti paṭhann andhapaṭam apanīya maṇḍalaṃ navātmakam oṃ herukavajra [ed-m p. 148] 

puṣpaṃ pratīccha hūṃ ityādimantrair dhūpādibhiś ca sampūjya he vajra paśyety uccārya maṇḍalaṃ devatānāṃ nāmakathanapūrvakaṃ darśayet.

iti maṇḍalapraveśavidhānānantaraṃ śiṣyaḥ pañcabhir aṅgair abhivandya pṛthivyām āropitadakṣiṇajānur kapotāñjalinā

	saṃsārapaṅkamagno 'haṃ trātā bhavāhi parāyaṇam |
	aham alpotsukā mandabhāgyā buddhadharmair vivarjitā |
	kṛpāṃ kuruṣva tvaṃ nātha he he nātha śāstā mahāguro ||

iti pāṭhenābhyarthayet. tata ācāryaḥ svanābhau jvalitacaṇḍālyā drāvitāmṛtena hṛdbījasnānasamaye niḥsṛtahṛdaṣṭanāḍīsvabhāvadevyo hṛdbījakiraṇākṛṣṭadaśadiktathāgatavidyādevībhiḥ sahitāḥ secayantv imaṃ kṛpāvatī kṛtāñjalir yācayāmi praṇipatti muhur muhur ity abhyarthitāś chattradhvajapatākāvastravādyādyanvitāḥ śubhrajñānāmbupūrṇakalaśahastā maṅgalaṃ gāyantyaḥ śiṣyaṃ herukarūpam abhiṣiñcanti yadā tadaiva yantrikādvaye sthitaṃ tāmrabhājanaṃ śaṃkhaṃ ca [ed-m p. 149 - begins after *laśā] vijayakalaśādijalenāpūrya prathamaṃ savjrakaradvayagṛhītena tāmrabhājanenālpajalena tadanu śaṃkhena

	abhiṣekaṃ mahāvajraṃ traidhātukanamaskṛtam |
	dadāmi sarvabuddhānāṃ triguhyālayasambhavam ||

oṃ heruka vīra tvām abhiṣiñcāmīti paṭhann abhiṣiñcan śiṣyaṃ mukuṭādhiṣṭhānaṃ kārayet.

tad evam udakamukuṭābhiṣekābhyām abhiṣiktaṃ śiṣyaṃ tathāgṛhītena śaṃkhena tāmrabhājanasthaśeṣasalilamiśritaṃ śeṣajalam oṃ buddhetyādimantraṃ prathamapaṭaloktaṃ paṭhan vāratrayaṃ pāyayed iti.

prayogā iti kṛtrimāḥ. anye vicoḍikādīny aṅgajaviṣāṇi. upaviṣaṃ lāṅgalīprabhṛti. kāṇḍaviṣaṃ viṣodakam ity arthaḥ. lepaneti khādyādiṣu lepanāni kṛtvā bhakṣaṇādyartham.

ye iti yāni viṣāṇi. te iti tāni sarvāṇi. tatraiveti yair daṣṭaṃ dattaṃ vā teṣv eva.

śālikākaraṇeneti śālikākaraṇamātraṃ yadīcchasi tadā tad eva jñāpyase. athavā gāruḍaṃ sarvaṃ laukikaṃ pāramārthikaṃ cety arthaḥ.

sahasretyādi. sahasraśatamadhye viśuddhāśayasyopadeśaṃ vakṣyamāṇaṃ mantre dadyāt.

sarpetyādi. sarpadaṣṭasya.

tatheti nirudyamaḥ. ayam arthaḥ—daṣṭe yāvad anyagāruḍī mantraprayogādikarma karoti kariṣyati vā tāvad buddhakapālayoginautsukyaṃ na kartavyam. kāladaṣṭo 'yaṃ mṛta ity anyagāruḍibhis tyakte daṣṭe karmārabdhavyam.

raśmaya ityādi. herukarūpasyātmano hṛdbījaraśmir vāsukiprabhṛtināgabhuvanaṃ preṣito nāgahṛdayaṃ śoṣayan kiṃ kurma iti bruvato nāgān [ed-m p. 150] āha—pūrvam iti. prathamapaṭale 'trāpi buddhakāpālabhāṣiṇīti smārayati. yūyaṃ mantraraśmyabhibhūtā bhagavatīṃ vijñāpya tadājñām aṅgīkṛtavanta iti bhāvaḥ. tato 'bhūd iti naivam ucitānuṣṭhānam iti bhāvaḥ.

āhety āhur nāgāḥ. gaccha raśme yasmān na kāladaṣṭaṃ na daṣṭo daṃśaḥ na daṣṭakaḥ kāladaṣṭād anyaḥ. 

śaṅkena śaṅkāviṣeṇa. na mriyante, śaṃkāpagamāt.

raśmiṃ raśmiḥ.

apatitagomayaṃ kapilāyā goḥ. tena śālikaṃ pakṣiṇaṃ śālikīṃ ca kuryāt. śuklamallikāṃ piṣṭaśuklataṇḍulakṛtām. tasyāṃ tat pakṣidvayaṃ sthāpayet. tasyāṃ śaṅkhādiśuklamallikāgolitacitāṅgāramasīṃ sthāpayet. tayā śvetakaravīralekhanyā śālikahṛdayamantraṃ likhet.

strīpuruṣam iti. strī śālikī tasyāḥ puruṣaḥ śālikaḥ. tur viśeṣe. atas tal likhitamantrabhūrjādipatradvayaṃ śālikahṛdaye śālikīhṛdaye ca prakṣiped iti sūcitam.

masīṃ dāpayed ityādi. tayā masyā śālikadvayaṃ citrayitvātmanaś cakṣuṣor abhimukhaṃ sthāpayitvā satyaśālikadvayavat paśyan śvetakaravīrapallavena mantraṃ paṭhan saptavārān āvāhitadivyaśālikadvayenābhinnaṃ bhāvayet. oṃ ityādi svāhānta eko mantraḥ. 

praviṣṭeti. tac chālikadvayaṃ gatvā praviṣṭaṃ nāgabhuvane. yenetyādi. daṃṣṭā nāgaḥ. śālikamahāsāmarthyaṃ dṛṣṭvā yadi na mriyate 'ndhaḥ punar bhaviṣyati. śālikān śālikadvayam. uvāca ūcuḥ. vācaṃ citrasenājñāṅgīkāravācaṃ nānyathā kurumaḥ. kvacit kurutheti pāṭhaḥ. tadā jīmūtavāhanena nāgānupadravārthaṃ kāritavācā [ed-m p. 151 - begins after garuḍā] garuḍādhirājena sarve mahābalapakṣiṇo vācaṃ kāritā atas tāṃ vācaṃ nānyathā kuruthety arthaḥ.

evam ityādi. śālikaśālikībhyāṃ mukhapucche gṛhītvā daṣṭasyāgra ānīto kuruthety arthaḥ. evam ityādi. śālikaśālikībhyāṃ mukhapucche gṛhītvā daṣṭasyāgra ānīto 'ndhasarpa āvāhanamantrābhimantritasarpavivaramṛttikayāvāhanamantrapāṭhapuraḥsaraṃ tāḍanāj jātacakṣur dṛṣṭadaṣṭasya caraṇāc chiraḥparyantaṃ gacchati śirasaś caraṇāntaṃ vāratrayaṃ. tata utthite daṣṭe 

śālikadvayaṃ sarpaṃ svasthānaṃ nītvā gataṃ svasthāne sadā sthāpayed iti samudāyārthaḥ. avayavārthas tu—gṛhītasyeti gṛhītā. sarpeṇa sarpaḥ. mṛtopapatitasyeti mṛtaṃ patitam. gatiḥ śiraḥparyantam. gamanaṃ caraṇaparyantam. śālikākaraṇaṃ sāṃvṛtaṃ gāruḍam uktvā pāramārthikam āha—śūnyatājñānam iti. tad eva nirdiśati—sunnetyādi. śūnyaṃ niḥsvabhāvaṃ sarvavikalpaleparahitaṃ sakalaṃ bāhyādhyātmikaṃ vastv iti bhāvāropaṃ nirākṛtyābhāvāropaṃ pratikṣipati—dhāmmaho. dharmo vastūnāṃ śūnyatā nāsti niṣprapañcatvāt tattvasya.

tāvad ityādi. ekaviṃśatidināni yāvat. 

kiṃ bahunā, yāvad yantraṃ mukhādikaṃ daṣṭasya na vighaṭate na vyādāya tiṣṭhati tāvat karma kuryāt.

upasaṃharati—evam ityādi. evaṃ śaṅkhodakapānaparyantenānugṛhyaivaṃ śālikīkaraṇaṃ pāramārthikaṃ ca gāruḍaṃ vyākuryāt. buddhakapālayogena oṃ buddhakāpālinī āḥ hūṃ ity anenaikaviṃśativārābhimantritaṃ viṣaṃ bhakṣayet. bāhyabhūmav iti maṇḍalasthānān maṇḍalaṃ visṛjya. anenety uktena rajomaṇḍalaṃ navātmakaṃ pūjayed iti pūrvavat. [ed-m p. 152] athavā dṛḍhacittaḥ sādhako herukātmānenoktapūjāmantreṇa yathākramaṃ pūjayed iti sambandhaḥ.

maṇḍalakaṃ candanādinety arthaḥ.

śubhradehina iti śubhraguṇopacayayuktam. anāhataṃ nirmastakaṃ śarmāśrayāntar ity upadeśaḥ. bhāṇḍamukhaṃ kumbhamukham. candram iti candro dravībhūtaḥ. utthate uttiṣṭhati.

iti paṇḍitābhayākaraguptakṛtāyām abhayapaddhatyāṃ buddhakapālamahātantraṭīkāyāṃ caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ.


