[ed-m p 153] rasāyanaṃ nirdeṣṭum āha—athetyādi. ṣaṇmāsaṃ tv iti naśyaṃ kuryād iti śeṣaḥ. kākinī prajñā yasyā kākasyeva rūpaṃ varṇaḥ kṛṣṇaṃ śarīrasya. haṃsinī prajñā yasyā haṃsaviśeṣasyeva rūpaṃ gauram. jaradī prajñā yasyā jararūpaṃ kṛṣṇagauramiśram. kaścin nīlavarṇāṃ jararūpam iti sarvadāsyās taptam a˙ngam ity āha. iti trividhā prajñā.

tatra kākinyāḥ kṛṣṇapakṣe sambhūtaṃ rajo grahītavyam. haṃsinyāḥ śuklapakṣasambhūtam. jaradyāḥ pakṣadvayasambhūtam.

kumāryādīnāṃ lakṣaṇam āha—śyāmetyādi. śyāmā kākinī nīlacakṣuṣā viśiṣṭā. tasyā aṣṭādaśavarṣāyā dravyaṃ cakṣurmalam, sampuṭayogam iti. upāyasampuṭayogajam ubhayabodhicittam, tasyā rajaś ceti trayaṃ kumārikocyate. tāsu tisṛṣu prajñāsu bhavatīti tadbhavam. tāsv api kasya tad ity āha—nāḍīnām avadhūtyādīnām. padmajaṃ dharmodayāyāṃ jātaṃ dravyaṃ bodhicittam.

tasyām api kva vyavasthitam ity āha—keśare nāḍīsamūhe. kiṃviśiṣṭe? gūḍhagocare. gūḍho gocaro dravyasthitiviṣayo yena. varaṭakān niḥsṛtya keśarastham ity arthaḥ.

ayam arthaḥ—tisṛṇāṃ prajñānām anyatamasyā dvādaśavarṣāyāḥ sampuṭayogajam ubhayabodhicittaṃ tasyāḥ prathamarajaś ceti dvayaṃ sārikā.

kusumavatītyādi. kākinyāḥ ṣoḍaśavarṣāyā rajasvalāyāḥ sampuṭajam ubhayabodhicittaṃ siddhā.

abhinnopacāreti sadṛśacaritrā nārī prajñātrayānyatamā. apuṃccchalānanyapuruṣagākṣatayonir ity arthaḥ.

[ed-m p. 154] tatprathamodbhavam iti tasyā viṃśativarṣāyā rajasvalāyāḥ prathamadina udbhūtaṃ rajas tadaiva tatsampuṭajabodhicittaṃ ceti dvayaṃ bālinī.

sahajetyādi. pañcaviṃśativarṣāyāḥ prajñātrayānyatamāyāḥ sampuṭajam ubhayaśukraṃ mṛtanārīkapālanāḍīsambhūtatailaṃ ceti dvayaṃ kāpālinī.

etāḥ pañcauṣadhyaḥ śuddharasaraktikayā saha yathākramaṃ ṣaṭtryekasārdhaikaikamāsānavicchinnaṃ prātaḥ prayoktavyāḥ. tatra kākībheṣajaṃ vāmena nāsāpuṭena vāyunirgamakāle nasyaṃ kuryāt. haṃsinībheṣajaṃ dakṣiṇena. jaradyā ubhābhyām ity āha—candretyādi. candro 'tra lalanāvāyuḥ.  sūryo rasanāvāyuḥ. candram iti śukraṃ sūryam iti rajaḥ. yadi tatra bheṣaje śukram udbhūtaṃ tadā vāmapuṭena. atha raja udbhūtaṃ tadā dakṣiṇena.

athāta ityādi subodham.

yoginīvarā iti. pañcāmṛtāni yoginyaḥ. yogavarāḥ pañca pradīpā upāyāḥ. śakyate bhakṣitum iti śeṣaḥ. vikalpaṃ vikalpāḥ. tathāgatair nabudhyata ityādir atiśayoktir ādarotpādanārtham. ke tarhi budhyanta ity āha—gurubhaktā ityādi. atikrāntaśāśvatādyantaśūnyatābhāvanayā rāgādirahitāḥ. ata eva sarve kleśā viḍambitā abhibhūtā ebhiḥ. khānādiṣv anāsaktāḥ.

prajñopāyādibhir iti sparśādipañcakāmaiḥ. pakṣam ekeneti pakṣaikeṇa. niruttaraprajñopāyayor ekarūpeṇa tattvaṃ samāhitāsamāhitāvasthayor bhāvayantaḥ. sidhyantīty arthaḥ.

tattvabhāvanāyām eva tātparyārthaṃ viṣayāsaktiṃ nivārayitum āha—hālo ityādi. mālaṃ viruddham. kim? yad indriyair bādhyante viṣayeṣv āsajyanta idaṃsatyābhiniveśino janāḥ. hā heti śocati. ṭaṇṭā mālaṃ tattvabhāvanāto 'nyatra khānapānādau cittasya vikṣepaḥ. chāyā pratibimbam. niyapaï [ed-m p. 155] iti. nijapataya ādarśādipañcajñānasvabhāvā vairocanādipañcatathāgatāḥ sidhyante tanmayo yogī bhavatīty arthaḥ.

ity abhayapaddhatyāṃ pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ.

