siktvā tattvaṃ prakāśayet. sekas tu maṇḍalapūrvakaḥ. ato 'dhimātrendriyo 'dhimātrendriyaṃ śiṣyaṃ manomaye maṇḍale 'bhiṣiñced iti pratipādayitum āha—athetyādi. bahirmaṇḍalābhiniveśinām uttrāsakaratvād ghoram. adhimātrendriyasya ratisthānatvād divyaṃ manomayam. lokottaraphalāvāhakatvād uttamam. yeneti maṇḍalena. prajñopāyavidhānena tv iti prajñopāyayor vidhānam anuṣṭhānaṃ tena. 

koṭiḥ khagamukhāgraṃ tayā yojyate sambadhyata iti koṭiyojanam.

bāhyamaṇḍalaṃ rajomaṇḍalam.

devatābhagnamātreṇeti pramādād avisarjitadaivatasya rajaso bhaṅgeneti gamyate, anyathā pūrvāpareṇa tantrāntaraiś ca virodhāt. ata eva devatābhaṅgasambhavād eva rajodevatāyāṃ grāhyagrāhakāvagraheṇa nāsti śuddhir advayajñānātmikā, manomayamaṇḍale tv astīty abhisandhiḥ.

devatābhaṅgavat taccihnabhaṅge 'pi pāpam ity āha—vajretyādi. akṣobhyādikulādhipatīnāṃ cihnāni, cakārād bījāny anyāsāṃ ca devatānām iti mantavyam. gatveti gacchati.

paramārthataḥ punar buddhā ityādi. kena na kenacit. ānayanādikaṃ tu mṛdusattvāśayavaśenoktam. kutracid iti na kvacit paramārthataḥ. tad uktam āryaprajñāpāramitāyām—

	na hi kulaputra tathāgatāḥ kutaścid āgacchanti gacchanti vā. acalitā hi tathatā, yā ca tathatā sa tathāgataḥ.

iti. nirmalam iti nirmalāḥ, rāgādirahitatvāt. jñeyāvaraṇarahitatvāc chuddhadharmakāyayuktāḥ. anya iti gamanādiprapañcamuktanirāvaraṇatathāgatebhyo 'nye tathāgatāḥ santi yeṣāṃ paramārthata ānayanādisambhave rajomaṇḍalaṃ nyāyyam iti ruciṃ na kuryāt. kim atra pramāṇam ity āha—atretyādi.

kīdṛśī prajñā yatkamale maṇḍalam ity āha—dvādaśābdikām ityādi. candrabhāgā samupacitabodhicittā. apuṃcchalety acañcalā, puruṣāntarāgāminīti yāvat. īdṛśīṃ prajñāṃ ḍhaukayeyur gurave śiṣyāḥ.  te tv eta eveti vakṣyamāṇaguṇayuktāḥ. tattvaṃ caturtham. pañceti jalamaulivajrādhipatyanāmāni. mantravajravratacaryāvratavyākaraṇāvivartaguhyāni vidyāvratena saha sapta. dvayaṃ prajñājñānaṃ caturthaṃ ca. ekamelāpaka ity eṣām ekatra melane caturdaśābhiṣekā bhavanti. tatra jalādyavivartānta  ācāryābhiṣeka ucyate. sa eva vidyāvratena saha bāhyaḥ. guhyaṃ guhyābhiṣekaḥ. guhyatattvaṃ prajñābhiṣekaḥ. tattvaṃ caturthābhiṣekaḥ. tathā ca vidyāvratam ācāryābhiṣeke prajñābhiṣeke vā tadaṅgatvenāntarbhāvyoktam—

	ācārya guhya prajñā ca caturthaṃ tat punas tathā |

iti.

niryātayed iti śiṣyo gurave suvarṇādikam.

gurum iti guruḥ. tūṣṇīṃ samādhim āmukhayan. sarvam idaṃ sūcitam eva na tu sphuṭaṃ sampūrṇam iti saṃgītikṛd āha—ayam ityādi.

ayam atropadeśaḥ. ihācāryaś caturviṃśatidevīparivṛtaśrīherukātmā śiṣyaṃ ca tathā śrīherukātmānaṃ vibhāvyāliṅgitacitrasenārūpakarmamudrāyathāvidhiśodhitakamalabhūmimadhye svahṛdbījamarīcisaṃcayākṛṣṭaṃ pañcaviṃśatyātmakaṃ bhagavantam avadhūtyūrdhvadvāreṇa praveśya dravībhūtabodhicittarajo vajramārgeṇa pātayet. tena jhaṭiti sakūṭāgārapañcaviṃśatidevatātmakaṃ manomayaṃ tripuṭaṃ maṇḍalaṃ vartayitvā śiṣyaṃ kṛtapañcamaṇḍalam

	praveśayasva māṃ nātha mahāmokṣapuraṃ varam |

iti trir yācitavantaṃ svaśarīre buddhyā praveśya vajramārganirgataṃ maṇḍalapūrvadvāre niṣaṇṇam

	svabhāvaśuddhabuddhātmadehaṃ prakṛtinirmalam |
	maṇḍalaṃ putra paśya tvaṃ vīravīreśvarīpuram ||

iti paṭhan maṇḍalaṃ darśayet. tataḥ “saṃsārapaṅkamagno 'ham” ityādinādhyeṣitavantaṃ caṇḍālīdrāvitāmṛtenāplāvyamānahṛdbījakiraṇākṛṣṭatathāgatavidyādevīnām ūrdhvadvāreṇa praviśya dravībhūya vajramārganiḥsṛtānām akṣobhyasvabhāvabodhicittajalena

	abhiṣekaṃ mahāvajraṃ traidhātukanamaskṛtam |
	dadāmi sarvabuddhānāṃ triguhyālayasambhavam ||

iti paṭhan

	oṃ tricakravīra tvām abhiṣiñcāmi

iti mantreṇābhiṣiñcet. ity udakābhiṣekaḥ.

tatas taj jalaṃ ratnasambhavātmamukuṭaṃ  bhāvayan

	abhiṣiñcantu māṃ sarvayoginyo mukuṭe 'trādhitiṣṭhantv āgacchantu hūṃ svāhā

iti pāṭhayet. iti mukuṭam.

amitābhātmavajraṃ savyakareṇa hṛdi

	adyābhiṣiktas tvam asi vīraiḥ śrīherukādibhiḥ |
	idaṃ tat sarvabuddhatvaṃ gṛhṇa vajraṃ susiddhaye ||

iti paṭhan grāhayet. iti vajram.

amoghasiddhisvabhāvāṃ ghaṇṭāṃ vāmakareṇa hṛdi grāhayan

	iyaṃ sā  sarvabuddhānāṃ ghaṇṭā ghoṣānugā smṛtā |
	tvayāpi hi sadā dhāryā bodhir agrā jinair matā ||

iti paṭhann āliṅganābhinayaṃ kārayet. ity ādhipatyam.

tataḥ śiṣyaśirasi vajraṃ ghaṇṭāṃ ca saṃdhārayan

	oṃ tricakrādhipati śrīherukavīra tvām abhiṣiñcāmi amukavajras tvam

iti paṭhet. iti nāma.

	oṃ buddhakāpālinī āḥ hī hai hūṃ phaṭ

iti hṛdayaṃ pāṭhayet. mantraḥ.

	idaṃ tat sarvabuddhatvaṃ śrīherukapade sthitam |
	tvayāpi hi sadā dhāryaṃ śrīherukadṛḍhavratam ||

iti paṭhan vajraṃ dadyāt. so 'pi

	oṃ sarvatathāgatasiddhivajrasamaya tiṣṭhaiṣa tvāṃ dhārayāmi oṃ ha ha ha ha hīḥ

iti paṭhan gṛhṇīyāt. iti vajravratam.

	gṛhṇa dattam ato vīra khaṭvāṅgaṃ ḍamarupātrakam |
	śrīherukamudreyaṃ bahiradhyātmasaṃsthitā ||

iti paṭhan khaṭvāṅgaḍamarukapālāni dadyāt. iti caryāvratam.

vāmakareṇa cīvarakarṇikām ādāya savyābhayakaraḥ

	eṣo 'haṃ tvāṃ tricakreśaḥ sarvabuddhamayaḥ svayam |
	śrīherukīti nāmnā vai vyākaromi tathāgatīm ||


śrīherukīti nāma tāthāgatī siddhiḥ. samayas tvaṃ bhūr bhuvaḥ svar iti paṭhet. vyākaraṇam.

tataḥ

	avaivartaṃ mahāsekaṃ mahāvīra dadasva me |
	nirnimittaṃ jagatkṛtyakartā yenāsmi sāmpratam ||

ity adhyeṣaṇānantaraṃ svahṛdraśmisamāhūtānantadigvartivīradevībhiḥ prāgvat praviśya vajrān niḥsṛtya jñānāmbupūrṇakalaśahastābhir maṅgalagītipūjāsatkāravistaraiḥ secayan

	abhiṣekaṃ mahāvajraṃ traidhātukanamaskṛtam |
	dadāmi sarvabuddhānāṃ triguhyālayasambhavam ||
	oṃ sarvatathāgatābhiṣekasamayaśriye hūṃ

iti paṭhet.
tato 'kṣobhyamaulinaṃ vicintyānyavīradevīs tatraiva jñānasattvarūpeṇa praveśya

	oṃ supratiṣṭhitavajre svāhā

iti mantram uccaret.

tadanv ājñāpayet

	nāsti kiṃcid akartavyaṃ yogināṃ tattvavedinām |
	jñātvā tattvaṃ tato vīra bhuṅkṣva tvaṃ kāmapañcakam ||

	pratibimbamayāḥ sattvāḥ pratītyotpādadharmiṇaḥ |
	evaṃ tridhātukaṃ jñātvā sattvārthaṃ tvam alaṃ kuru ||

ity avivartaḥ.

tadanu “saṃsārapaṅkamagno 'ham” ityādinā guroḥ 

	saṃsārapaṅkamagno 'haṃ trātā bhavāhi sundarī |
	chinnā vāsanā yukto 'haṃ vikalpabahulena ca |
	tām upaśāmayatu devī mahāyaśā kṛpāvatī ||

iti prajñāyāś cādhyeṣaṇāṃ kṛtavantaṃ svahṛdbījaraśmyānītadaśadigvartivīradevīnāṃ prāgvat praviśya dravībhūya niḥsṛtānāṃ bodhicittaṃ hṛdayamantraṃ paṭhan maṇḍalasthitabuddhyā bahiḥsthitaṃ śiṣyaṃ jyeṣṭhānāmikābhyāṃ prapīḍya vajraṃ padmād uddhṛtya sākṣāt pāyayet. śiṣyas tu “aho sukham” iti vadan pibet. prajñāpy utthāya  svanīrajāntarālāvaśiṣṭamakarandabindūṃs tadānanāntarāle nirambaraiva niveśayet. iti prajñopāyayor guhyenābhiṣeka iti guhyam.

tataḥ prāgvad guruṃ prajñāṃ cādhyeṣitavantaṃsā prajñānyā vājñāpayati

	kiṃ tvam utsahase vīra bodhicittasya bhakṣaṇam |
	pañcavarṇasamudbhūtāṃ vidyāṃ sampūjya bhaktitaḥ ||
	viṅmūtrabalaraktādibhakṣaṇaṃ prati sāmpratam |
	anyac ca samayaṃ divyaṃ brūhi vatsa yathepsitam ||

iti. so 'pi

	kim ahaṃ notsahe devi yathoktaṃ samayādikam |
	kiṃ na bhaktiḥ sadā kāryā strīṇāṃ padmārcanaṃ na kim ||

iti svīkurvīta. tataḥ sā padmaṃ vikāsya “bhaja mokṣaṃ hoḥ” iti vadet. so 'pi guror upadeśād avagatānandādiprabhedo ramet.

	kamalākāśe maṇivaraṭakayoḥ pīḍanasthāne

	vajraparyaṅkataś cittaṃ maṇyantargatam īkṣayan |
	yat tad utpadyate jñānaṃ jñānaṃ tadrūpam ity alam ||
	
	na rāgo na virāgaś ca madhyamā nopalabhyate |
	trayāṇāṃ varjanād eva sahajaḥ sambodhir ucyate ||

	indī jattha vilīna ga¨u naṭṭha vi appasahāva |
	so hale sahajāṇandagaï phuḍa pucchaha gurupāva ||

ity ākalayya

	yāvan na kurute yogī bodhicittavisarjanam |
	tāvat prāpnoty avicchinnaṃ kim apy ānandajaṃ sukham ||

	patite bodhicitte tu sarvasiddhinidhānake |
	mūrcchite skandhavĳñāne kutaḥ siddhir aninditā ||

iti yathāśakti saṃdhārya śanair utsṛjya rasanayāmbhoruhāt tattvadṛṣṭyā gṛhṇīyād bodhicittaṃ samayarūpam. tadanu sā śirasi vāmāṅghriṃ dattvānujñāṃ dadyāt.

	adyaprabhṛti putra tvaṃ yāvad ā bodhimaṇḍataḥ |
	svapnavat sarvasattvānām arthaṃ sarvātmanā kuru ||

iti prajñājñānam.

tato guruḥ

	nānyopāyena buddhatvaṃ hitvā vidyām imām iti |
	cara vidyāvrataṃ vatsa vratānām uttarottaram ||

iti vadet. vidyāvratam.

tadanu gṛhītaprajñājñānasyaiva śiṣyasya prajñājñānam evābhyāsād vajradhararūpaṃ caturtham iti vācaiva caturthābhiṣekaṃ gurūpadeśato boddhavyaviśeṣaṃ dadyāt.

tad uktaṃ śrīsampuṭe—

	dattvābhiṣekaṃ vidhibhir yathoktaiḥ
	śiṣyādhimuktiṃ manasā samīkṣya |
	udāragambhīranayādhimukter
	vācaiva dadyād abhiṣekaratnam ||

iti caturthābhiṣeka iti.

[below begins ed-c p. 46] yas tu madhyendriyaḥ śiṣyas tam bāhye bhāvitaprajñāsvabhāve dharmodayākamalodare koṭiyojanamānaṃ manomayaṃ tripuṭamaṇḍalaṃ vibhāvya yathāyogam uktavidhinā 'bhiṣiñcet | yat puṇyasañcitam idaṃ maṇḍaladvayam utpannasāmarthyena guruṇā nirmitaṃ sphuṭaṃ paśyati so 'adhimātrādhimātrendriyaḥ śiṣyas tam apy evam abhiṣiñcet mṛdvindriyan tu rajomaṇḍale paṭamaṇḍale vā | ity upadeśo vibhajya vivṛta-āmnāyabhraṃśabhayāt | 

