tad uktaṃ ghaṇṭāpādaiḥ

	citrasthakarmasūtrarajaḥpātakramoditam |
	jaganmaṇḍalam evedaṃ prakṛtyā siddham advayam ||

	kṛkrimadvayarūpaṃ yat tad vineyavaśān matam |
	tan na sādhyaṃ mumukṣūṇāṃ muktir bhūtārthadarśanād iti ||

yadyevaṃ vidham utpannaṃ tarhi sarvadāstyeva kiṃ jagannāvagacchati kiṃ vā bhāvanayetyāha | vāhi a | bādhitaṃ viparyastaṃ svapnasvabhāvaskandhāday mohena | tasmād dekkhaniropayate upādeyaḥ | heyañ ca mohaṃ dahanti drtam | yāvad iyam aviśvastākṣaṇasampadastīti bhāvanāyāṃ niyojayatīti |

paṇḍitābhayākarakṛtāyām abhayapaddatyāṃ śrībuddhakapālamahātantraṭīkāyāṃ ṣaṣṭhaḥ paṭalaḥ || 6 ||



