[ed Chog (I think)]

idānīṃ phalatantrasya bhagavato bhāvanām abhidhātuṃ vineyajanānurodhād bahirmaṇḍalaṃ tāvad āha—athetyādi. girītyādi yathārutārtham.

vartulam ityādi. tatrāyaṃ kramaḥ. yathāvidhi parikarmitāyāṃ hastena spṛṣṭvāṣṭottara bhūśodhanamantrajāpād vā viśodhitāyāṃ maṇḍalabhūmāv asmatkṛtakālacakrāvatāroktanyāyena śaṅkucchāyāmatsyābhyāṃ digvidigniścayaṃ kṛṭvā devatāmūrtir dattabalir ācāryaḥ prathamaṃ pūrvābhimukho bhūtvā bhāvitapratyekapañcajñānātmapañcatathāgatasvarūpapañcaviṃśatyā sūtrair vartitenācāryayavasthaulyena navena maṇḍaladviguṇadīrgheṇa vitastyadhikena sūtreṇa vāmavajramuṣṭyā nābhau dhṛtena devamūrtiśiṣyādinā saha jñānasūtrākhyabrahmasūtradvayam ākāśe nipātyādhas tadbhūmau brahmasūtram ekaṃ praguṇaṃ pātayet.

tato maṇḍalacaturasratvasiddhaye matsyamukhapucchayor upari dvitīyaṃ. brahmasūtram uttarābhimukhaṃ pātayet. tato hastādipramāṇamaṇḍalasya mūlasūtracatuṣṭayam, tataḥ koṇasūtradvayaṃ yathāvidhi pātayet.

tato brahmasūtrād bahiḥ pūrvādidiśaṃ vrajan rajobhūmimānena sūtram ekaṃ tyaktvā sūtracatuṣṭayam. punaḥ sūtram ekaṃ tyaktvā sūtradvayam. tataḥ sūtram ekam. tadanu sūtradvayaṃ tyaktvā devatāpaṭṭikāsūtram ekam. evaṃ brahmasūtram ārabhya mūlasūtreṇa saha daśa sūtrāṇi bhavanty ekapārśve. pārśvāntareṣv apy evaṃ kramaḥ. tato mūlasūtrād bahiś cakrāṣṭabhāgika dvāracaturthabhāgamānena rajobhūmisūtram ekam. tato dvārārdhapramāṇaṃ devatāvedyāḥ sūtram ekam. tato rajobhūmimānena ratnapaṭṭikāsūtram ekam. tato vedīpramāṇaṃ hārārdhahārapaṭṭikāsūtram ekam. tato rajobhūmimānena bakulī paṭṭikāyāḥ kasyacin mate punā ratnapaṭṭikāyā vā sūtram ekam. tato 'ndhakārapaṭṭikāsūtram ekaṃ kharvitam. tatraiva kramaśīrṣāṇi. tato lopaprayāsabhayāt kharvitasūtreṇa dīrgheṇaiva vā dvārāt triguṇasya toraṇasya sūtracatuṣṭayam. tataḥ sūtradvayaṃ tyaktvā toraṇasambaddhasūtram ekam. 

tataḥ sūtratrayaṃ tyaktvā saghaṇṭāmārutoddhūtapatākādhvajacchatrakalpavṛkṣādisthānasūtram ekam. punaḥ sūtram ekaṃ tyaktvā sūtram ekam. tataḥ padmadalāvalīsūtram ekam. ata eva padmavaraṭakāntaḥsthaviśvavajravedīsthitaṃ kūṭāgāram, tadvedībahiḥ padmavaraṭake tu viśvavajrāratoraṇādikaṃ likhyate. tato vajrāvalīsūtram ekam. tataḥ sūtradvayaṃ tyaktvā prabhāvalīsūtram ekam. padmadalāvalī nāstīti kaścit. koṅkaṇas tu vajrapadmacakraprabhāvalīsūtrāṇi catvāry āha. evaṃ rajobhūmisūtram ārabhya ṣoḍaśa sūtrāṇy ekapārśve. evaṃ pārśvāntareṣv apīti ṣaḍviṃśatisūtre dvipuṭamaṇḍale ṭippanavidhiḥ.

anayaiva diśā tripuṭādimaṇḍalasūtraṇavidhir unneyaḥ.

evam ekadā sūtraṇenaiva navatrayodaśapañcadaśonaviṃśatipañcaviṃśatidvātriṃśat saptatriṃśad yāvat śatasahasrādisaṃgrahamaṇḍalavidhir jñeyaḥ. atra toraṇādiṣv ((avāntarasūtrāṇaviśeṣo)) bhūśodhanādikaṃ loparajaḥpātādikaṃ ca savistaram uktam asmābhir maṇḍalopāyikāyām.

trivajrapariveṣṭitam iti tisṛbhir nīlaraktaśuklavajrāvalībhir valayitam.

jhaṭiteti hūṃkārād evaikasmāt pañcaviṃśater yoginīnāṃ bhagavataś cotpatteḥ. tatra niḥsṛtā iti bhagavadutpattisamaye hūṃkārāt.

pañcavarṇavibhūṣitam ity ādhāramaṇḍalam.

hūṃkārātmiketi hūṃkārād utpanna ātmā yasyāḥ sā tathā. kṛṣṇā gaurāḥ śyāmāś ceti madhya dvitīyatṛtīyapuṭasthā yathākramam. dvārapālinyas tu kṛṣṇā madhyapuṭasthā iva.

akṣobhyakṛtamaulinam iti madhyasthitākṣobhyasya pradhānatvenoktam. uktaṃ hi pañcabuddhamaüḍa maṇḍitam iti.

sarvayoginya iti pañcaviṃśatiḥ. tādṛgrūpā iti yathā bhagavān śirasi mudritas tathā tā api mudritāḥ. kiṃ tu tāsāṃ śirasi sthitas tathāgato nāyakaḥ pṛthak pṛthag ity āha—paraṃ hītyādi. kāmayet kāmayanti. yoginyaḥ sumālinyādayaś catasraḥ. dvārapālya ity eke guravaḥ.

visāägaü viṣādaṃ gato 'si parārthaṃ prati śūnyataikaniṣṭhatvāt. vaäṇeti jagaduddharaṇapratijñām. sambhalasi smarasi. sāṃi sakalasya svāmin. kajjeti svārthamātraṃ kṛtvā. pūvvaäpaï ityādi. pūrvaṃ pater yathā pratijñātaṃ smara. visāü viṣādaṃ saṃsāraduḥkhopadrutatvāt. miccheṃ mithyā parikalpite bhāvānte 'bhāvānte māṇety abhimānam. bhāveti graham.

evaṃ tarhi bhāvagrahaḥ syād ity āha—phiṭṭaü ityādi. yoginīvṛndakamanena śūnyataikarasamahāsukhodayād bhāvābhāvādiparāmarśakṣayo bhavatīty arthaḥ.

pūrvavad vaktracihnādāv iti hetuvajradharavat. varṇas tu nīlaḥ phalavajradharasya. hetuvajradharasya tu śukla iti tantrāntare. iha tu nīla eva. kvacit pūrvavad varṇacihnādāv iti pāṭhaḥ. tadā hetuvajradharo 'pi nīla iti sphuṭam.

uṭṭhita iti citrasenāsahitaḥ.

nanv ādarśajñānādisvabhāvacandrasūryādipariṇato hetuvajradhara āmnātaḥ. tathā kim ayam api? na, taddravaprasūtahūṃjasavajrahūṃkārād utpatteḥ.

tat kiṃ phalavajradharo na pañcajñānamayaḥ? naivam, suviśuddhānām eṣāṃ tadrūpeṇotpatteḥ. tathā hi yasmin sarvaṃ jagad darpaṇa iva pratibimbitaṃ pratibhāti tad ādarśajñānam. samatājñānaṃ yena tathā pratibimbitasya jagataḥ samatāṃ pratipadyate. pratyavekṣaṇājñānaṃ yena tathā samāhita eva sarvasattvānāṃ cittacaritāni pratyavekṣate. kṛtyānuṣṭhānajñānaṃ yena tathā pratyavekṣitasya jagataḥ kṛtyam anutiṣṭhati. suviśuddhadharmadhātujñānaṃ yat savāsanāvaraṇadvayamuktamahāsukhamayakṛpāprajñādvaya dharmadhātvadhigamaniṣpattiḥ. ataḥ phalavajradhṛg api pañcajñānasvabhāvaḥ.

etāni tu jñānāny ādikarmiko 'dhimokṣeṇa bhāvayati, candrarūpam eva mano 'tisvaccham ādarśaḥ sarvasya jagataḥ, candrasūryasamāgame mahāsukhamayasya manasaḥ sarvadharmāṇāṃ pratibimbopamatvenāpi bhedānīkṣaṇāj jagadartha nirūpaṇāparam aparimitair nirmāṇais tadarthakāri tathāvirbhūtam ity abhisandhibhiḥ. niṣpannas tu tadarthanirūpaṇato 'bhyasyatīty alaṃ bahunā.

ayam atra yathāmnāyaṃ bhāvanākramaḥ. iha bhāvanādhikṛto mantrī caturdevīsaṃgītasaṃcodanāvibuddhaḥ prātar utthāya hūṃ phaṭ iti oṃ āḥ hūṃ iti vā sthānātmayogarakṣāṃ kṛtvā śmaśānādau manonukūle sthāne sukhāsane vajraparyaṅkeṇa niṣaṇṇaḥ saprajño niṣprajño vā nagno muktakeśo dakṣiṇābhimukhaḥ sarvakarmasu, śāntikādibhedena tu yathāsvaṃ digabhimukhaḥ samayadravyasevāpūrvakaṃ vakṣyamāṇakrameṇāmṛtaṃ prasādhya baliṃ dattvā svahṛdi mārtaṇḍa maṇḍala nīlīna kuliśamuṣṭiniviṣṭa hūṃkārakiraṇanikarair akaniṣṭhaniṣṭhaṃ bhagavantaṃ herukaṃ nijapreyasīcitrasenāsamāliṅgitaṃ sumālinīprabhṛticaturviṃśativajravilāsinīparikāritam ātmābhimukhaṃ vakṣyamāṇavarṇādikam ānīya purato 'mbare hūṃkāre tadraśmipraveśānāntaraṃ hūṃkārād yugapan nirgatābhir vajradevībhiḥ pūjayet.

tatra bhagavataḥ pūrvasyāṃ diśi vajradāḍhī kamalābhinayakaradvayadhṛtakapālena rajaḥ pāyayati prabhum. aiśānyāṃ vajradūtī hastābhyāṃ ḍamarū vādayati. āgneyyāṃ vajraghoṇā kamalābhinayadhṛtakapālena vairocanaṃ bhojayati. naiṛtyāṃ vajriṇī tathādhṛtārghapātraṃvajrāmbupūrṇam arpayati. dakṣiṇasyāṃ vajravikaṭā paṭahaṃ hastābhyāṃ vādayati. vāyavyāṃ vajranābhis tathādhṛtakapālena mṛgalāñchanaṃ nivedayati. vāruṇyāṃ vajraghorā tathādhṛtakapālena luveti prasiddhajambukabalaṃ kavalayati. uttarasyāṃ rāgavajriṇī citrasenayā saha tadātmībhūya samāliṅgya māhānurāgeṇānurāgyati.

nṛtyagītādibhiś ca sampūjyābhivandya pāpadeśanādikam iti kuryāt: 

deśayāmy aham ātmanaḥ sarvapāpaṃ na punaḥ kariṣye. anumode sarvapuṇyāni sarvabuddhabodhisattvāryapṛthagjanānām. pariṇāmayāmy ātmanaḥ sarvakuśalam anuttarāyāṃ samyaksambodhau. ā bodhes trīṇi ratnāni śaraṇaṃ gacchāmi yad uta buddharatnaṃ prajñāpāramitādharmaratnam avaivartikabodhisattvāryasaṃgharatnaṃ ca. aho batāham anuttarāṃ samyaksambodhim abhisambudhyeya tanmārgānuṣṭhānena sarvasattvānām arthāya hitāya sukhāya yāvad eva teṣām atyantaniṣṭhe nirvāṇe niruttare ca tāthāgate jñāne pratiṣṭhāpanāya. tadanv adhaḥ samīraṇapreraṇa jvalitacaṇḍālīsamāliṅgita hṛdayahūṃkāraraśmibhir nikhilakalevaraṃ kavalayan 

	oṃ śūnyatājñānavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham

ity asyāntarjalpapūrvakam artham āmukhayansarvadharmaśūnyatāyāṃ praviśet.

tadanu prācīnaprṇidhānāvedhād raṃbījanitaravibimbe hūṃkāraparinataviśvavajratanmadhyāsīnahūṃkārayoḥ preṅkhanmayūkhaśākhābhir vajraprākārapañjaraśarajālavitānasīmābandhān vidhāyādhaḥ kuliśavasudhāyāṃ tadviśvāśanivinirmitāyā ūrdhvam [ed-C p. 52 - begins with viśvavajra] ekārajaśubhratryasradharmodayāntaḥsarojavaraṭakasthaviśvavajravedyāṃ yaṃjātadvipatākadhanurnibhanīlānilamaṇḍalopari raṃkārapariṇataṃ raktaṃ tryasraṃ niryat saptajvālam analamaṇḍalam. tatsaṃvāsivaṃbhavakalaśalāñchitavartula dhavalasalilamaṇḍalanilīnaṃ laṃkṛtivikṛtiṃ kalitadambholicatuṣkoṇaṃ kamanīyakanakamedinīmaṇḍalam.

evaṃ svasvabījādhiṣṭhitabhūtacatuṣṭayaghaṭitaṃ kūṭāgāram antar vartulatripuṭaṃ bāhye

	caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ catustoraṇabhūṣitam |
	hārādyair apsarobhiś ca bhāsvadvedī catuṣṭayam ||
	sarvaratnamayaṃ stambhaiḥ kiṅkiṇībhiś ca maṇḍitam |

tasya madhye viśvāṣṭadalakamalasya karṇikāyāṃ dharmadhātusvabhāvaṃ mṛtakam, tadupari hṛdi mārtaṇḍamaṇḍale dviguṇālipariṇataṃ dvātriṃśallakṣaṇa kāraṇaṃ śītadyutibimbam ādarśajñānasvabhāvaṃ dviguṇitayaralavaḍaḍha sahitavyañjanapariṇatam aśītyanuvyañjananibandhanam uṣṇāṃśuḥ samatājñānasvarūpaḥ. tanmadhye hūṃkārajapañcāravajragarbhasthahūṃkāraḥ prajñopāyātmakaḥ pratyavekṣaṇājñānasvabhāvaḥ. sa eva niryat pañcākāraraśmisphuritadevatābhir abhito jagadarthakārī kṛtyānuṣṭhānajñānasvabhāvaḥ. etaccandrādipariṇataḥ suviśuddhadharmadhātujñānasvabhāvo bhagavān buddhakapālo hetuvajradharo 'bhinavonnidrakandalīkusumakāntis tantrāntaranyāyena kundāvadātadyutideho vā vakṣyamāṇaphalavajradharavadbhujādiko raktacitrasenāliṅgito hūṃkārād bhagavanniṣpattikāla eva niṣpannābhiḥ sumālinīprabhṛticaturviṃśatidevībhiḥ parikarito bhāvyaḥ. kecid asmadguravo 'trāpi prastāve bhagavāṃś caturviṃśatidevīḍhaukitakapālasthapañcāmṛtaṃ pibatīty āhuḥ.

tadanu citrasenāyāḥ śirasi kaṇṭhe hṛdi guhya ūrvoś ca yathākramaṃ oṃ āḥ hūṃ svāhā ity etān vibhāvya tair anyonyāvadhi sphuradbhir asyāḥ śarīram abhiv yāpya hrīḥkārajaraktapadmavaraṭake raktam āḥkāraṃ bhagavadvajraṃ kṛṣṇahūṃkārajaṃ śubhrauṃkārādhiṣṭhitāgraṃ vibhāvya caturviṃśatidevyaś citrasenayā sahābhinnās tathāvidhavajrābjasaṃyogād bhagavantaṃ kāmayanti. bhagavāṃś ca

	oṃ sarvatathāgatānurāgaṇavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham

iti mantreṇa ratim ārabhamāṇo mahārāgeṇa bhagavatyā saha dravībhūtaḥ sūryoparī. ity ayam ādiyogo nāma prathamaḥ samādhiḥ.

tato dravāt pūrvapraṇidhiviśeṣāpekṣāt spharitāś catasro devyaḥ [ed-C p. 53] prabhum apaśyantyaḥ sotkaṇṭhaṃ gītikābhir utthāpayanti nātham. tatra sumālinī mahāmaitrīsvabhāvā

	kibbhaṇi tuä visāä gaü loa ṇimantiä kāṃi |
	taha vaäṇa jaï sambhalasi uṭṭhahi saäla vi sāṃi ||

ity anayā gītikayā.
kāpālinī mahākaruṇātmikā

	kajja appāṇa kariaï piya mā kara suṇṇa vi citta | 
	bhavabhaapaḍiaü saalajaṇu uṭṭhahi joiṇimitta ||

ity anayā.

bhīmā mahāmuditāsvabhāvā

	puvvapaïjjaha saṃbhalasi mā kara kājjavisāu | 
	taïṃ atha milleṃ saalajaṇu paḍiaü jaga avasāu ||

ity anayā. durjayā upekṣātmikā

	miccheṃ māṇa ma karahi pia chaḍḍahi suṇṇa ho bhāva| 
	kāmahi joiṇivinda tuhuṃ phiṭṭaü ahavā bhāva ||

ity anayā.

evaṃ saṃcodanānantaraṃ taddravaprasūtahūṃjanitasavajrahūṁpariṇato bhagavān heruko nīlavarṇa ekavaktraś caturbhujaḥ savyena bhujadvayena ḍamarukartī bibhrāṇo vāmena khaṭvāṅgakapāle viśvasarasīruhaśayāluśavoraḥsthalīmilanmārtaṇḍamaṇḍalīni baddhārdhaparyaṅkena śṛṅgārādi navanāṭyarasair nṛtyan galāvalambisārdrapañcāśannaraśiraḥśreṇiḥ kṛtasārdranṛtantuyajñopavītaḥ paridadhad dvīpicarma paścādbhāge purobhāge tu nagnaś cakrīkuṇḍalakaṇṭhīkeyūrarucakaskhalanmekhalānūpuraghurghurāravavirājitaḥ pañcabuddhamukuṭī [ed-D p. 54] viśvakuliśārdhaśaśāṅkāṅkitajaṭāviṭapī lalāṭakoṭipariṇaddhapañcakapālamālaś citibhasmabhūṣitaḥ kṛtrimakrodhamahāraudramūrtir udañcaccaṇḍa marīcimaṇḍalapratimanetratrayī hūṃkāragarjātarjitavicūrṇitadṛpyanmāracamūcaritaḥ paramapremorukaruṇayā saṃsārasāgaradarīmagnamūrtīṃs tanūbhṛtaḥ samuddharann antarnibaddhaśvāsena yoginā bhāvanīyaḥ.

asya ca prabhoḥ preyasī citrasenā bhagavatā sahaiva hūṃkārāj jātā nirvasanā niraṃśubhūṣaṇā parihṛtanaraśiraḥśreṇir ūrdhvapiṅgalajvalitamuktakuntalakalāpā bandhūkakusumakāntikhelallāvaṇyalaharīkaśarīrā kiṃcitkarāladaṃṣṭrāṅkuraikavaktrā trinetrā salīlāliṅgitabhartṛkandharā vāmakarakroḍitakapālagalitanijasarojavivaraviniḥsṛtakusumadhārāṃ prabhuṃ pāyayantī tribhavasaṃvāsiśreyaḥpathaparipanthivarūthinīhananābhinayenopari

praguṇasakarttidakṣiṇabhujamañjarīkā saśītkārādharasudhāvidhānādibhiś caturaratikalākelibhiḥ sravacchukrā nirbharaṃ bhartur mano mañju rañjayantī.

anayor dampatyor utpattisamasamaye sumālinīprabhṛtikuliśāvilāsinya utpannāḥ. tatra bhagavadāsanāt prācīne dale sumālinī, udīcīne kāpālinī, paścime bhīmā, dakṣiṇe durjayā. aiśānyādividikpatreṣu dakṣiṇāvartena śukrarajaḥpañcāmṛtapañcapradīpapūrṇāni kapālāni. idam ādyaṃ puṭam aṣṭadalakamalaṃ nīlakuliśāvalīvalayitam.

tato dvitīyaṃ puṭaṃ raktāṣṭārasthāṣṭapadmam abhinavaghūṣṛṇāruṇadambholimālāvalayitaṃ bahiḥ paritaḥ. tasya pūrvātrāre śubhamekhalā, uttare rūpiṇī, paścime vijayā, dakṣiṇe kāriṇī, aiśāne kālinī, āgneye mahodadhiḥ, nairṛtye kāriṇī, vāyavye māriṇī.

tatas tṛtīyaṃ puṭaṃ śuklāṣṭārasthāṣṭapadmaṃ śuklavajrāvalīveṣṭitam. tasya pūrvāsminn āre tāriṇī, uttare bhīmadarśanā, paścime sudarśanā, dakṣiṇe 'jayā, aiśāne śubhā, āgneye ostārikī, nairṛtye kālarātrī, vāyavye mahāyaśāḥ.

tataḥ pūrvadvāre padme sundarī, uttarāsmin padme vasundharā, paścime 5 padme subhagā, dakṣiṇe padme priyadarśanā.

sarvā imāḥ kavalikarttikapālasavyetarapāṇipallavā bhartṛbhāvasphuradadhareṣaddanturadantaikavaktrā digambarā niraṃśubhūṣaṇā muṇḍamālārahitāḥ [ed-c 55] piṅgordhvā jvalanmuktakacasaṃcayā atirāgāc chukraṃ sravant yo 'bhinavonnidramandārasundararavibimbeṣv ardhaparyaṅkeṇa nṛtyavatyaḥ, dvārapālyās tu catasraḥ pratyālīḍhapadena. sarvā vyāghracarmaparīdhānā jvalitagabhastayo vaktrai raktadhārāḥ sravantyas trinayanāḥ śṛṅgārādirasarāśayo 'bhinavodbhinnendranīlaśilāśakalavarṇavapuṣmatyaḥ.

athavā sumālinyādayaś catasraḥ kṛṣṇāḥ, dvitīyapuṭinyo gaurāḥ, tṛtīyapuṭavartinyaḥ śyāmāḥ, dvāradev yaś catasraḥ kṛṣṇāḥ.

anye tv asmadguravaḥ sumālinī śuklā, kāpālinī pītā, bhīmā śubhrā, durjayā kṛṣṇā, dvitīyapuṭinyo raktāḥ, tṛtīyapuṭasthāḥ śuklāḥ, sundarī śuklā, vasundharā pītā, subhagā raktā, priyadarśanā kṛṣṇā, vistaratantroktatvādity āhuḥ. yathāruci bhāvanīyāḥ, pakṣadvayasya laghutantroktatvāt.

