sumālinī, jālandhare śikhāyāṃ kāpālinī, oḍḍiyāne dakṣiṇakarṇe bhīmā, arbude mastakapṛṣṭhe durjayā. pīṭhaṃ pramuditābhūmiḥ. godāvaryāṃ vāmakarṇe sundarī, rāmeśvare bhrūmadhye vasundharā, devīkoṭṭe cakṣuṣoḥ subhagā, mālave skandhadvaye priyadarśanā. upapīṭhaṃ vimalābhūmiḥ. etā aṣṭau cittacakre khecaryaḥ.

kāmarūpe kakṣayoḥ śubhamekhalā, oḍre stanadvaye rūpiṇī. kṣetraṃ prabhākarībhūmiḥ. triśakunau nābhyāṃ vijayā, kośale nāsāgre kāriṇī. upakṣetram arciṣmatībhūmiḥ. kaliṅge mukhe kālinī, laṃpāke kaṇṭhe mahodadhiḥ. chandohaḥ sudurjayābhūḥ. kāñcyāṃ hṛdi kāriṇī, himālaye meḍhre māriṇī. upacchandoho 'bhimukhībhūmiḥ. vākcakre bhūcaryaḥ.

pretapuryāṃ liṅge tāriṇī, gṛhadevatāyāṃ gude bhīmadarśanā. melāpakaṃ dūraṃgamābhūḥ. saurāṣṭre ūrudvaye sudarśanā, suvarṇadvīpe jaṅghāyām ajayā. upamelāpakam acalābhūḥ. nagare 'ṅgulīṣu śubhā, sindhau pādapṛṣṭhayor ostārakī. śmaśānaṃ sādhumatībhūmiḥ. marāv aṅguṣṭhayoḥ kālarātrī, kulatāyāṃ jānau [ed-c 58] mahāyaśāḥ. upaśmaśānaṃ dharmameghābhūḥ. kāyacakre pātālavāsinyaḥ.

bodhicittādicatuṣṭayaṃ mahāsukhādicakracatuṣṭaye. bhagavaccitrasenayoḥ karṇikādvayaṃ sthānam.

iha bhagavān sāṃvṛtabodhicittātmā, citrasenā rajaḥsvabhāvā. bodhicittādicatuṣṭayaṃ anyac ca sarvam anayoḥ spharaṇam. svasvasthānasthā nāḍīsvabhāvāś caturviṃśatidevīr bhagavān eva sphuraṇena samāliṅgati yathopadeśaṃ yathātattvaṃ yathādhimokṣaṃ caṇḍālīprabhedabhāvanayā. sarvaṃ caitat paramārthataḥ śūnyatāmahāsukhamayakaruṇābhinnasvarūpacitrasenābuddhakapālasvabhāvam eva vibhāvanīyaṃ jagac ceti.

yadi punar yogī cittaṃ sthirīkartum icchati sarvasiddhīnām āśuniṣpattaye tadā samāsataḥ samādhitrayaṃ vibhāvya catuḥṣaṣṭidalakamalanirmāṇacakrasyordhvamukhasya granthiśuṣire nīlaṃ āṃ, aṣṭāradharmacakrasyādhomukhasya nīlaṃ hūṃ, ṣoḍaśārasaṃbhogacakrasyordhvamukhasya raktaṃ oṃ, dvātriṃśadāramahāsukhacakrasyādhomukhasya śuklaṃ haṃ, guhyacakrasthavāyuvahnisaṃcoditacaṇḍālīsvabhāvasya aṃkārasya jvalitaraśminā drāvitena hūṃkārādyakṣaratrayeṇa sahābhinnaṃ aṃkāraṃ sahajānandamayabindubhūtaṃ vīraṃ bhāvayan bhāvanāparipākam adhimucya tasmād eva sūkṣmaraśmirekhāṃ jvalitaikajvālāvad avasthitāṃ paśyet. tasyāḥ prabhāveṇa sravadamṛtapūraplāvito vīraḥ, sā ca raśmirekhā śītībhavet. tato vīre niyamitacittas tāvat paśyed yāvac cetasaḥ sthairyalābhaṃ nimittair upalakṣayet. upalakṣite tu sthairye tasyā raśmirekhāyāḥ sphuṭam ālokaṃ viśvam avabhāsayantaṃ vicintya sarvaṃ karatalāmalakavat paśyet, sarvasamādhīṃś cāśu niṣpādayed iti binduyogaḥ.

yathopadeśaṃ yathādhimokṣaṃ caṇḍālīprabhedaṃ ca bhāvayet.

japtavidyasya siddhir iti jāpa ucyate. tatra bhāvanākhedān mūlamantro 'yaṃ japyaḥ.

oṃ hrīḥ buddha hūṃ kāpālinī āḥ.

