iti mantreṇa dattvā sarvam idaṃ kuśalam anuttarāyai samyaksambodhaye 'bhimatasiddhaye ca pariṇamayya pūrvavat pūjāṃ kṛtvā caturviṃśatimāṇḍaleyyo 'dhyātmani pīṭhādicaturviṃśatisthānasthāsu nāḍīṣu yathopadeśam antarbhāv yāḥ, bodhicittakapālaṃ mahāsukhacakre, rajaḥkapālaṃ nirmāṇe, pañcāmṛtakapālaṃ hṛdi, pañcapradīpakapālaṃ gale.

