madhyāhnasāyamardharātrasandhyāsu jhagiti sphāritasarvāntaḥpuracakreṇa kavacādikam akhilam anuṣṭheyam. śayanasamaye tu prāgvad drutībhūtaṃ śūnyatāsvabhāvasahajānandamayam ātmānaṃ nidrāṃ ca tatsvabhāvām adhimucya svaptavyam. utthātukāmatāyāṃ pūrvavac caturdevīsaṃcodanāj jhaṭity utthāya tathaiva sakalam avikalam ākalayitavyam. evaṃ pratyahaṃ yāvat siddhinimittāni labhyante. snātavyam abhiṣekavidhinā, sarvaṃ bhakṣaṇam amṛtāsvādavidhineti.

yadā punar ayam eva bhagavān niṣprajño bhāvyate tadā hetuvajradhara ityādi bhagavān heruka ityantaṃ grantham, asya ca prabhoḥ preyasītyādi laghutantroktatvād ityantam, catasṛbhir ityādi vaśīkṛtyetyantam, tatretyādi mudrayed ityantam, bhagavadbhagavatītyādi prīṇayed ityantam, tadanv adhyātmam ityādi prabhedabhāvanayetyantam, citraseneti caturviṃśad ityādi samāliṅgitetyantam, prāgvad drutībhūtam iti pūrvavac caturdevīsaṃcodanād iti ca vihāya sarvam anyad uktaṃ jñātavyam. viśeṣas tv amuṣya bhagavataḥ [ed-c p. 60 - begins with pratyag] prākudākpratyagavākkamaladaleṣu yathāsaṃkhyaṃ oṃ hūṃ khaṃ svaḥ iti bījajanitāś citrasenākāminīpātālavāsinīsaubhadrā nīlavarṇāḥ pratyālīḍhapadā vyāghrājinanivasanāḥ sav yabhujadvayena karttikapāle vāmakaradvayena khaṭvāṅgaḍamaruke bibhrāṇāḥ. aiśānyāgneyanairṛtyavāyavyadaleṣu yathākramaṃ hūṃhūṃhūṃhūṃparīṇatāḥ śauṇḍinībhūtinī caturbhujākāśavāsinyaḥ pītavarṇāḥ sphuratpītaraśmiśarīrā ālīḍhacaraṇā dakṣiṇapāṇipallavābhyāṃ karttiḍamaruke vāmabhujamañjarībhyāṃ khaṭvāṅgapadmabhājane dadhānāḥ.

aṣṭāv apy amūr niratiśayaśṛṅgārādirasodgāragarbhā abhinavāmārtaṇḍamaṇḍaleṣu tāṇḍavinya īṣaddaṃṣṭrākarālavaktrakamalā jvalatpiṅgalordhvamūrdhajā mūrdhni pañcakapālamālinyo niraṃśu mayacakrīkuṇḍalakaṇṭhīrucakamekhalāghurghurākeyūranūpurābharaṇā galāvalambisārdrapañcāśannaraśiraḥśreṇayaḥ kalpāntajvalanā pratimāvijṛmbhamāṇakiraṇakavalitamāramaṇḍalā aṭṭāṭṭahāsamahāghorā ekavaktrā vaktrai raktaṃ sravantyas trinayanāś caturbhujā bhujaṃgamān atiśayam uttrāsayantyaḥ prabhum abhimukhaṃ nirīkṣamāṇā nirūpaṇīyāḥ.

iha bhagavantaṃ vajrasattvaṃ pañcabuddhamaüḍamaṇḍitam iti vacanād akṣobhyādipañcabuddhair mudrayet. citrasenādīs tu yathākramam akṣobhyavairocanaratnasambhavāmitābhaiḥ. śauṇḍinyādīr apy evam. ādhyātmikāmṛtaprīṇanaṃ caṇḍālīprabhedabhāvanayaiva.

