[ed-c p. 64] upāyāṅgaṃ nirdiśati | athetyādi | kāṣṭheneti tantrāntaroktena | puṣpeṇetyudeśaṃ nirdiśati | pañcapuṣpam iti vakṣyamāṇapadmādipuṣpāṇi pañca | kṣīreṇety upalakṣaṇatvād ghṛtādibhiḥ | adhyātmahome tu pañcaprajñānāṃ rajāṃsi pañcapuṣpāṇi kṣīraṃ puruṣasya ca bodhicittaṃ, samāpattau tadrajomiśraṃ jñeyam ity anyatroktam iha na yat prastutam | śāntika ityādi iha caturasraṃ kuṇḍaṃ taryag adhaś ca dvādaśāṅgulam | tanmukhasyopari caturaṅgulāntaraṃ tyajet | tatra caturdikṣu śuklavikarālapañcasūcika vajram | tadvahis tiryag ucchrayābhyāṃ caturaṅgulā kuṇḍasaṃsthānā manāgavanatamukhī samantato vedī koṇeṣu triśūkavajrāṅkitā barhirnīlatrisūcivajrāvalīveṣṭitā | kuṇḍamadhye dharmodayā madhyasthakūṭāgāre 'ṣṭāṅgulaṃ padmaṃ nīlaraktaśūklatrivajrāvalīpariveṣṭitam | padmopari prāk śiraḥ pañcasūcikacaturaṅgulapramāṇam ekāṅgulocchrayaṃ vajraṃ tadupari padmaṃ tanmadhye sūryaḥ | tadupari hrīḥ kūṭāgārakoṇeṣu pītanavaśūkavajrāṇi sarvam idaṃ vikarālavajrādikaṃ rajasaṃlikhedapīti samudāyārthaḥ | avayavārtha ucyate | hūṃkārātmajaṃ hūṃjasvarūpam adhimuñcet hūṃkāragarbham iti vā | cakraṃ kūṭāgāram | trikoṇadharmodayā | evaṃ mayeti caturakṣarajanitapṛthivyādibhūtacatuṣṭayapariṇatam adhimuñcec cakram | kiṃjalkena kiṃjalkopalakṣitapadmena viśiṣṭam | guṇaṃ dviṣoḍaśottaraśatadvayam | khalu keneti kukumaviśeṣeṇa | tale padmam iti | vajrasya tale padmam aṣṭadalam | aṅguladvādaśeti ācāryāṅgulena | tatreti kuṇḍe | ekaikasyeti āmnādīnām | raktavajrakapāladhṛtam iti raktaṃ vajraṃ kapālaṃ ca cihnam | raktena pūrṇaṃ sūnyateti | kuṇḍamadhye kiñcin na likhet | pañcamāṃsena gokudahanamāṃsena | agnīty agniḥ proktaḥ | eṣāṃ śāntikādīnām | aparaviśeṣo 'smatkṛtahomopayikāyāṃ jyotimañjaryām ihoktaṃ [ed-c 64] viśeṣaviparītaṃ parityajya grāhyaḥ | sarvañ caitat saṃvṛtyā | paramārthatas tu kojvalaï ity ādīti |

paṇḍitābhayākaraguptakṛtāyām abhayapaddhatyāṃ śrībuddhakapālamahātantraṭikāyāṃ aṣṭamaḥ paṭalaḥ || 8 ||



