12.1 añjanasiddhim uddeṣṭum āha—athetyādi |

12.2 pradhānabhūtā caturviṃśatiyoginīnām |

12.3 dṛṣṭā dṛṣṭāni | ya iti yeṣu | na bhāṣitaṃ tantrāntareṣu |

12.4 mahābhāgā praśasyā nirāvaraṇabalavaiśāradyādimahāguṇabhajanāt | sattvārthatātparyāt parārthasampad uktā | hetvavasthāsvarūpatvāt sarvabuddhajananī | phalarūpatvān mahāmudrā | yogī yoginaḥ |

