12.16 saptatālapramāṇo bhavaty ativṛṣṭinivāraṇārthaḥ |

12.17 mahātmana iti prabhāvād iti śeṣaḥ |

12.18 svarūpaparivartanasyeti prathamārthe ṣaṣṭhī |

12.19 prayogeti prayogā vidyādharatvādiniṣpattaye laghutantre noktā vistare tūktā jñātavyā guruvaktrāt |

12.20 mantrajāpaviśeṣe 'kṣasūtraviśeṣaṃ vaktum āha—athetyādi |

12.21 hastyasthikena hastyasthnābhicārārthaṃ japet |

12.22 mahāsthi nrasthi |

12.23 śakunāsthi gṛdhrāsthi |

12.24 lohakena lohākṣasūtreṇa |

12.25 sarvo 'yam utpattikramapakṣe 'pi prapañcas tathā tathā vineyajanānurodhād uktaḥ, utpannakrame tu kim anenety āha—citte ekkv ityādi | cittam evaikaṃ nirmalādarśas traidhātukasya, tena hi yac cintyate tat pratibimbam ivābhāti, sarvaṃ cedaṃ cittasamāropitam, tac ca cittaṃ paramārthataḥ svapna[ed-l p. 18]rūpaṃ sarvaprapañcavarjitam, ye na jānanti mūḍhās te santvavikalavikalpamahimānaḥ, ye 'pi ca śrutādinā jānanti tathāpi ta evaṃvidhavikalpena gṛhyanta iti niṣprapañcatattvabhāvanāyām udyojanākūtena karuṇāyitam iti |

abhayapaddhatyāṃ dvādaśaḥ paṭalaḥ ||

