13.1 kramadvaye 'pi tattvam eva sarvāvaraṇamalaviśuddhir ity āha — athetyādi |

13.2 viśuddhipaṭalam iti viśuddhaṃ tattvaṃ viśuddhiḥ, na tu tattvamātraṃ viśuddhiḥ, tattvasya sarvatra sarvadā ca bhāvāt sarveṣāṃ sarvadā ca viśuddhiprasaṅgāt |

13.3 tat punar asukaram upāyatattvam antareṇa sākṣātkartum iti yathā tad upāyopetaṃ vajrayānāśrayeṇa sākṣātkartavyaṃ tad darśayitum āha — bhaginītyādi |

